 "MY-H3975": {
  "lawId": "MY-H3975",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (DanaInfra Nasional Berhad )\n(No. 2) Order 2026.\n\nInterpretation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order—\n\n\"guarantee\" means the guarantee given or to be given by\nthe Government of Malaysia in relation to the ICP and IMTN Programme and RC-i Facility;\n\n\"RC-i Facility\" means the Syndicated Revolving Credit -i Facility obtained by\nthe DanaInfra Nasional Berhad  with an aggregate principal amount not exceeding\none billion ringgit (RM1,000,000,000.00);\n\n\"ICP and IMTN Programme\" means the Islamic Commercial Papers and Islamic\nMedium Term Notes issued or to be issued by the DanaInfra Nasional Berhad pursuant\nto the Islamic Commercial Papers and Islamic Medium Term Notes Programme with\nnominal value of up to  eight billion six hundred eighty -one million and one hundred\ntwenty thousand ringgit (RM8,681,120,000.00)  including the aggregate principal\namount obtained under the RC-i Facility.\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53] by—\n\n(a) DanaInfra Nasional Berhad, any financier of the RC -i Facility or\nany other party in respect of any money payable under any agreement,\nnote, instrument and document in relation to the RC -i Facility and\nthe guarantee;\n\n(b) DanaInfra Nasional Berhad or any holder of the Islamic  Commercial\nPapers or Islamic Medium Term Notes or any other party in respect of\nany money payable under any agreement, note, instrument and\ndocument in relation to the ICP and IMTN P rogramme and\nthe guarantee; or\n\n(c) any party to whom the agreement, note, instrument and document\nin relation to the funding obtained by DanaInfra Nasional Berhad under\nthis Order is transferred or assigned,\n\nshall be remitted in full.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of\nany agreement, note, instrument and document in relation to the ICP and IMTN\nProgramme, the RC-i Facility and the guarantee shall be remitted in full.\n\nMade 18 August 2026\n[MOF.SID(S)700-14/2/53; PN(PU2)232/JLD.19]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\nFinance Minister II"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
