    "text": {
     "en": "1.      (1)    This order may be cited as the Co-operative Societies (Assumption of\nControl) (Appointment) (No. 4) Order 2019.\n\n (2)     This Order comes into operation on 5 November 2019.\n\nAssumption of control"
    },
