 "MY-H4016": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4016",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Co-operative Societies (Assumption of Control\nof Koperasi Peneroka Felda Kemahang (1) Berhad) (Reappointment) Order 2021.\n\nReappointment for assumption of control"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Commission reappoints Mohd Shihabuddin bin Mohd Yazid to assume control\nof the whole of the property, business, activities and affairs  of the Koperasi Peneroka\nFelda Kemahang (1) Berhad, and carry on the whole of its business, activities and affairs\nfor the period from 8 July 2021 until 7 July 2022 or until a new Board is elected\nunder the by-laws of the Koperasi, whichever is earlier.\n\nCosts, expenses and remuneration"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any costs and expenses incurred by the Commission, and the remuneration\nof the person reappointed under paragraph 2, in relation to the assumption of control\nunder paragraph 2 shall be payable out of the funds and properties\nof the Koperasi Peneroka Felda Kemahang (1) Berhad as a first charge.\n\nMade 5 July 2021\n[SKM.IP(SULIT)(KP): 3369/1/3JLD.2; PN(PU2)527/XX]\n\nZAZALI BIN HARON\nDeputy Executive Chairman\nMalaysia Co-operative Societies Commission"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
