 "MY-H4094": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4094",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Highway Authority Malaysia\n\n(Incorporation) (Set Backs of Highway) (Amendment) Regulations 2026.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 29 August 2026.\n\nAmendment of regulation 2"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Highway Authority Malaysia (Incorporation) (Set Backs of Highway)\n\nRegulations 2007 [P.U. (A) 339/2007], which are referred to as the \"principal\n\nRegulations\" in these Regulations, are amended in regulation 2—\n\n(a) by substituting for subregulation (1A) the following subregulation:\n\n\"(1A) Any person preparing a design for the construction of\n\na highway with an elevated highway structure for the purposes of\n\nthis Act shall provide a distance of 10 metres from the edge of the\n\nouter part of the elevated highway structure to the edge of the\n\nhighway reserve on both sides of the highway mainline as set backs\n\nof the highway.\";\n\n(b) by inserting after subregulation (1A) the following subregulation:\n\n\"(1B) The requirement for set backs under subregulations (1)\n\nand (1A) shall apply to any upgrading or widening of any highway\n\non any highway reserve and no additional set backs shall be\n\nrequired.\"; and\n\n(c) in subregulation (2), in the national language text, by substituting for\n\nthe words \"lorong laju, lorong perlahan\" the words \"lorong pecutan,\n\nlorong nyahpecutan\".\n\nNew regulation 3"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The principal Regulations are amended by inserting after regulation 2\n\nthe following regulation:\n\n\"Set backs of highway on road reserve\n\n3. Notwithstanding regulation 2, any person preparing a design for\n\nthe construction of a highway on any road reserve for the purposes of this Act\n\nshall provide set backs for the highway in accordance with the set backs\n\napplicable to the road reserve.\".\n\nMade 27 August 2026\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/1/2 Jld.3; PN(PU2)368/JLD.10]\n\nDATUK SERI UTAMA Ir. HASNI BIN MOHAMMAD\n\nChairman\n\nHighway Authority Malaysia\n\nApproved 27 August 2026\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/1/2 Jld.3; PN(PU2)368/JLD.10]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMinister of Works"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
