     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] is amended\n\nin the First Schedule under the heading of Negeri Selangor Darul Ehsan —\n\n(a) by inserting after item 58 the following items:\n\n\"59. (Route 30): Lingkaran Bandar U4 Road\n\n(a) Starting at coordinates N 2.894856, E 101.649383 and ending\n\nat coordinates N 2.894481, E 101.657654 within the\n\nboundaries of the right of way as shown on MAP 30:\n\nLINGKARAN BANDAR U4 ROAD, NEGERI SELANGOR\n\n(a distance of 0.900km); and\n\n(b) Starting at coordinates N 2.894733, E 101.698740 and ending\n\nat coordinates N 2.929732, E 101.709904 within the\n\nboundaries of the right of way as shown on MAP 30:\n\nLINGKARAN BANDAR U4 ROAD, NEGERI SELANGOR\n\n(a distance of 5.300km).\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting after MAP 29: SUNGAI BERTIH-TANJUNG SHAWAL ROAD,\n\nNEGERI SELANGOR the following map:\n\nMade 14 October 2020\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/1 Jld.5; PN(PU2)391/XXXIX]\n\n DATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nSenior Minister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]\n\n\"MAP 30: LINGKARAN BANDAR U4 ROAD, NEGERI SELANGOR\n\nWILAYAH PERSEKUTUAN\n\nPUTRAJAYA\n\nHighway\n\nN 2.894481\n\nE 101.657654\n\nNEGERI SELANGOR\n\nN 2.894856\n\nE 101.649383 N 2.894733\n\nE 101.698740\n\nN 2.929732\n\nE 101.709904\n\nN 2.936612\n\nE 101.713142\n\nNEGERI SELANGOR\n\nE20\n\nLength of Gazetted\n\nRoad = 0.900km Length of Gazetted\n\nRoad = 5.300km\n\nLEGEND:\n\nROAD TO BE GAZETTED AS\n\nFEDERAL ROAD\n\nFEDERAL ROAD\n\nROUTE NUMBER\n\nSTATE ROAD\n\nSTATE BOUNDARY\n\n.\"."
