     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Syarie Legal Profession\n(Federal Territories) (Fee) Rules 2023.\n\n(2) These Rules are deemed to have come into operation on 21 June 2022 and\nshall continue to be in operation until 31 December 2023.\n\nNo imposition of fees"
