     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (West Malaysia) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989]\n\nis amended in the First Schedule under the heading of Negeri Perlis Indera Kayangan—\n\n(a) by inserting after item 13 the following item:\n\n \"14. (Route 251): Abi Tok Hashim Road\n\n Starting from the junction of Route 7, Kangar-Padang Besar Road\n\nat coordinates N 6.437554, E 100.193285 and ending at Route 7,\n\nKangar-Padang Besar Road at coordinates N 6.453979,\n\nE 100.206775 including its link road within the boundaries\n\nof right of way as shown on MAP 13: ABI TOK HASHIM ROAD\n\n(a distance of 3.299 km).\";\n\n(b) by inserting after MAP 12: KODIANG-KANGAR ROAD the following map:\n\n\"MAP 13: ABI TOK HASHIM ROAD\n\n\".\n\n\";\n\nMade 25 October 2024\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/16; PN(PU2)391/JLD.50]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Minister of Works\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Federal Roads Act 1959]"
