     "en": "1. This  order  may  be  cited  as  the  Customs  (Values) (Palm Oil) (No. 36 )\nOrder  2011   and   shall   have  effect   for   the  period   from   5  September 2011   to\n11 September 2011.\n\nLevy and payment of customs duties"
