 "MY-H4314": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4314",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pembangunan Sumber Manusia Berhad\n\n(Exemption of Levy) (No. 4) Order 2021.\n\n(2) This Order has effect for the period from 1 January 2021 to 30 June 2021.\n\nExemption of levy"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The Minister exempts any employer to whom this Act applies and registers\n\nwith the Corporation who is affected by the Coronavirus Disease 2019 (COVID-19)\n\npandemic from paying any levy as specified under sections 14 and 15 of the Act in respect\n\nof each of his employee.\n\n(2) The exemption of levy under subparagraph (1) is subject to the\n\nfollowing conditions:\n\n(a) the application for such exemption is made by the employer to and\n\nreceived by, the Corporation before 5 March 2021; and\n\n(b) the employer has incurred a reduction in annual revenue of more\n\nthan thirty percent based on the latest certified financial statement\n\nor financial report; or\n\n(c) the employer is currently receiving the latest incentives relating to\n\nits business as announced by the Federal Government at the time\n\nthe application for such exemption is made.\n\nNon-application"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The exemption under paragraph 2 shall not apply to any employer who has\n\nbeen given an exemption under the Pembangunan Sumber Manusia Berhad\n\n(Exemption of Levy) (No. 3) Order 2021 [P.U. (A) 315/2021].\n\nMade 22 July 2021\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)600-1/2/19/1; PN(PU2)616/V]\n\nDATUK SERI SARAVANAN A/L MURUGAN\n\nMinister of Human Resources"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
