 "MY-H4335": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4335",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1.    (1)       These rules may be cited as the Income Tax\n(Deduction for Expenditure on Issuance of Sukuk) Rules 2015.\n\n(2)       These Rules shall have effect from the year of assessment 201 6 until the\nyear of assessment 2018.\n\nInterpretation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2.    In these Rules—\n\n\"company\" means a company resident in Malaysia and—\n\n(a) incorporated under the Companies Act 1965 [Act 125]; or\n\n(b) incorporated under the Labuan Companies Act 1990 [Act 441];\n\n\"sukuk\" means—\n\n(a) sukuk structured pursuant to the principle of Ijarah; or\n\n(b) sukuk structured pursuant to the principle of Wakalah, comprising\na mixed component of asset and debt.\n\nDeduction"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3.   For the purpose of ascertaining the adjusted income of a company from its\nbusiness in the basis period for a year of assessment, a deduction shall be allowed on an\namount equal to the expenditure incurred by the company on the issuance of sukuk—\n\n(a)      approved or authorized by , or lodged with , the Securities Commission\nunder the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007 [Act 671]; or\n\n(b)      approved by the Labuan  Financial Services Authority established under\nthe Labuan Financial Services Authority Act 1996 [Act 545].\n\nMade 28 December 2015\n[CR(8.09)294/6/4-9(SJ. 9)(2015)(SK. 2); LHDN 01/35/(S)/42/51/286-54;\nPN(PU2)80/LXXIX]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 154(2) of\nthe Income Tax Act 1967]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
