 "MY-H4353": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4353",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 6) Order 2018.\n\nApplication"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. This Order shall apply to—\n\n(a) the Islamic Medium Term Notes issued by Perbadanan Tabung\nPendidikan Tinggi Nasional pursuant to the Islamic Medium Term Notes\nProgramme in nominal value of up to three billion ringgit\n(RM3,000,000,000.00); and\n\n(b) the guarantee provided or to be provided by the Government of Malaysia\nin relation to the Islamic Medium Term Notes referred to in\nsubparagraph (a).\n\nInterpretation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. In this Order—\n\n\"Sukuk Murabahah guarantee\" means the guarantee referred to in\nsubparagraph 2(b);\n\n\"Sukuk Murabahah\" means the Islamic Medium Term Notes referred to in\nsubparagraph 2(a).\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53] by any of the following\nindividual or entity in respect of any money payable un der any  agreement, note,\ninstrument and document in relation to  the Sukuk Murabahah  and the\nSukuk Murabahah guarantee shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional to which the Loans\nGuarantee (Bodie s Corporate) Act 1965 applies by virtue of the Loans\nGuarantee (Declaration of Bodies Corporate) (Perbadanan Tabung\nPendidikan Tinggi Nasional) Order 2004 [P.U. (A) 408/2004];\n\n(b) any holder of the Sukuk Murabahah; or\n\n(c) any party to any agreement, note, instr ument and document in relation to\nthe Sukuk Murabahah and the Sukuk Murabahah guarantee, including any\nparty to whom such agreement, note, instrument and document are\ntransferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instrument and document in relation to the Sukuk Murabahah and\nthe Sukuk Murabahah guarantee shall be remitted in full.\n\nMade 14 December 2018\n[MOF.SID(S)700-14/2/8; PN(PU2)232/XV]\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMinister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
