    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This Order may be cited as the Anti-Money Laundering, Anti -Terrorism\nFinancing, Anti-Restricted Activity Financing  and Proceeds of Unlawful Activities\n(Amendment of Second Schedule) Order 2026.\n\nSubstitution of Second Schedule"
    },
