 "MY-H4394": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4394",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Price Marking of Price-Controlled Goods) (No. 5) Order 2013.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 28 October 2013 to\n6 November 2013.\n\nPrice marking"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Any person who  sells or offers to sell any price -controlled goods\npublished in P.U. (A) 320/2013 shall affix a pink coloured label indicating the price per\nunit or per unit weight, the name describing such goods and the grade or quality, if any,\nof such  price-controlled goods.\n\n (2) Any person who fails to comply with subparagraph (1) commits an\noffence and shall, on conviction, be liable—\n\n(a) where such person is a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding\ntwenty thousand ringgit and, for a  second or subsequent offence,\nto a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit; or\n\n(b) where such person is not a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding\nten thousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent offence, to a\nfine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit.\n\nMade 25 October 2013\nKPDN (PGK)(S)26/0.5001/1 Jld.12; PN(PU2)695/III]\n\nDATO' HASAN BIN MALEK\nMinister of Domestic Trade,\nCo-operatives and Consumerism"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
