     "en": "4. Paragraph 3 of the principal Order is amended—\n\n(a) in subsubparagraph (a)—\n\n(i) by deleting the words \"(f ormerly known as 1MDB Real Estate\nSendirian Berhad)\"; and\n\n(ii) by substituting for the words \"the Loans Guarantee (Declaration of\nBodies Corporate) (TRX City Sdn. Bhd.) Order  2012\" the words\n\"the Loans Guarantee (Declaration of Bodies Corporate)\n(TRX City  Sdn. Bhd. (formerly known as 1MDB Real Estate\nSendirian Berhad)) Order 2012\"; and\n\n(b) in subsubparagraph (d), by substituting for the words \"and/or\"\nthe word \"or\".\n\nMade 7 October 2022\n[MOF(R)100-1/2/2 Jld. 2(19); PN(PU2)232/JLD. 17]\n\n TENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n                                 Minister of Finance"
