 "MY-H4414": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4414",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 2) Order 2021.\n\n (2)  This Order comes into operation on 31 July 2021.\n\nApplication"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. This Order shall apply to—\n\n(a) the Islamic Commercial Papers and the Islamic Medium Term Notes\nissued or to be issued by Syarikat Prasarana Malaysia Berhad pursuant\nto the Sukuk Murabahah  Programme with nominal value of up to\nseventeen billion ringgit (RM17,000,000,000.00) which is referred to as\nthe \"Sukuk Murabahah\" in this Order:\n\n              Provided that the combined aggregate of the outstanding nominal\nvalue of the Sukuk Murabahah and the outstanding principal amount\nunder the Syndicated Revolving Credit -i Facility which is referred to as\nthe \"RC-i Facility\" in this Order, shall not exceed seventeen billion ringgit\n(RM17,000,000,000.00);\n\n(b) the RC -i Facility obtained or to be obtained by Syarikat Prasarana\nMalaysia Berhad with the aggregate outstanding principal amount\nnot exceeding four billion ringgit (RM4,000,000,000.00) subject to\nthe combined aggregate referred to in subparagraph (a); and\n\n(c) the guarantee provided or to be provided by the Government of Malaysia\nin relation to the Sukuk Murabahah and the RC Facility -i referred to in\nsubparagraphs (a) and (b).\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3.  Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53] by any of the following\nindividual or entity in respect of any money payable under any agreement, note,\ninstrument and document in relation to any of the Sukuk Murabahah, the RC-i Facility\nand the guarantee referred to in paragraph 2, shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) Syarikat Prasarana Malaysia  Berhad to which the Loans Guarantee\n(Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 applies by virtue of the Loans Guarantee\n(Declaration of Bodies Corporate) (Syarikat Prasarana Negara  Berhad)\nOrder 2001 [P.U. (A) 351/2001];\n\n(b) any holder of the Sukuk Murabahah;\n\n(c) any financier of the RC-i Facility; or\n\n(d) any party to any agreement, note, instrument and document in relation to\nthe Sukuk Murabahah , the RC -i Facility and the guarantee referred to in\nparagraph 2 , including any party to whom such agreement, note,\ninstrument and document are transferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instrument and document in relation to the Sukuk Murabahah ,\nthe RC-i Facility and the guarantee referred to in paragraph 2 shall be remitted in full.\nMade 30 July 2021\n[MOF.SID(S)700-14/2/9 JD.3 (SK4); PN(PU2)232/XVI]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMinister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H4415": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4415",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 4) Order 2022.\n\n (2)  This Order comes into operation on 12 October 2022.\n\nApplication"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. This Order shall apply to—\n\n(a) the Islamic Commercial Papers and the Islamic Medium Term Notes\nissued or to be issued by Prasarana Malaysia  Berhad\n(formerly known as Syarikat Prasarana Negara Berhad)  pursuant to\nthe Sukuk Murabahah  Programme, which is referred  to as\nthe \"Sukuk Murabahah \" in this Order , with nominal value\nof two billion ringgit (RM2,000,000,000.00); and\n\n(b) the guarantee given  or to be given by the Government of Malaysia\nrelating to the Sukuk Murabahah.\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3.  Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53] by any of the following\nindividual or entity in respect of any mon ey payable under any agreement,\nnote, instrument or  document in relation to the Sukuk Murabahah or the  guarantee\nreferred to in paragraph 2 shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) Prasarana Malaysia  Berhad to which this Act applies  pursuant to\nthe Loans  Guarantee (Declaration of Bodies Corporate)\n(Syarikat Prasarana Negara Berhad) Order 2001 [P.U. (A) 351/2001];\n\n(b) any holder of the Islamic Commercial Papers and th e Islamic Medium\nTerm Notes issued or to be issued by Prasarana Malaysia  Berhad\npursuant to the Sukuk Murabahah; or\n\n(c) any party to any agreement, note, instrument or document in relation to\nthe Sukuk Murabahah  or guarantee referred to in paragraph 2 ,\nincluding any party to whom such  agreement, note, instrument or\ndocument is transferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of\nany agreement, note, instrument or document in relation to the Sukuk Murabahah\nor guarantee referred to in paragraph 2 shall be remitted in full.\n\nMade 7 October 2022\n[MOF(R)100-1/2/2 JLD. 2(17); PN(PU2)232/JLD. 17]\n\n  TENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n                                                                                     Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
