 "MY-H4449": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4449",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Anti-Money Laundering , Anti-Terrorism\nFinancing and Proceeds of Unlawful Activities  (Amendment of Second Schedule )\n(No. 2) Order 2014.\n\nAmendment of Second Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Anti-Money Laundering, Anti-Terrorism Financing and Proceeds of Unlawful\nActivities Act 2001 is amended in the Second Schedule—\n\n(a) by inserting the following items under  the heading \"Common Gaming\nHouses Act 1953 [Act 289]\":\n\nOffences Description*\nSection 4B Offences relating to dealing in\ngaming machines\nSection 9 Buying lottery ticket\n\n(b) by inserting after the heading \" Firearms (Increased Penalties) Act 1971\n[Act 37]\" and the item relating to it the following heading and item:\n\n\"\n\n\";\n\nOffences Description*\nImmigration Act 1959/63 [Act 155]\nSubsection 56(1) Offences of harbouring persons who\nhave contravened the Act, making\nfalse report, etc.\n\n(c) by inserting after the hea ding \"Optical Discs Act 2000 [ Act 606]\" and the\nitems relating to it the following heading and item:\n\nOffences Description*\nPassports Act 1966 [Act 150]\nSubsection 12(1) Offences of forging, altering or\ntampering of passport, internal\ntravel document or visa, etc.\n\n(d) by inserting the  following items under the  heading \"Penal Code\n[Act 574]\":\n\nMade 27 November 2014\n[BNM.JUN 1125/3603; PN(PU2)622/XVII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\nOffences Description*\nSection 130V Member of an organiz ed criminal\ngroup\nSection 130W Assisting an organized criminal group\n\"\n\"\n\"\n\".\n\n\"; and\n\n\";"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
