    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Customs Duties Order 2017 [P.U. (A) 5/2017] is amended\nin the First Schedule―\n\n(a) in relation to subheading 3506.99.00 10, in column (5),  by substituting for\nthe words \"22%\" the words \"18%\";\n\n(b) in relation to subheadings 3707.90.10 00 and 3707.90.90 00 , in column (5),\nby substituting for the words \"13%\" the words \"10%\";\n\n(c) in relation to heading 3 9 . 2 3, by substituting  for subheading  3923.10.90 00\nand  the  particulars relating to it the following particulars:\n\nP.U. (A)\n\nHeading\n\n(1)\n\nSubheading\n\n(2)\n\n                Description\n\n(3)\n\nUnit of\nQuantity\n\n (4)\nRate of Duty\nImport\n\n(5)\nExport\n\n(6)\n\n \"3923.10.90\n\n 3923.10.90 10\n\n3923.10.90 90\n\n - - Other:\n\n  - - -     Boxes, cases, crates\nand similar articles,\nof plastic, specially\nshaped or fitted for\nthe conveyance or\npacking of\nsemiconductor\nwafers, ma sks, or\nreticles, of\nsubheading 3923.10\nor 8486.90.\n\n - - -      Other\n\n kg\n\nkg\n\n15%\n\n20%\n\n  0%\n\n 0%\";\n\n(d) in relation to subheading 4911.99.90 10, in column (5),  by substituting for\nthe words \"15%\" the words \"7%\";\n\n(e) in relation to subheading 8414.59.49 10 ,  in column (5),  by substituting for\nthe words \"20%\" the words \"18%\";\n\n(f) in relation to heading 8 4 . 2 1, by substituting  for subheading  8421.39.90 00\nand  the  particulars relating to it the following particulars:\n\nHeading\n\n(1)\n\nSubheading\n\n(2)\n\n                 Description\n\n(3)\n\nUnit of\nQuantity\n\n (4)\nRate of Duty\nImport\n\n(5)\nExport\n\n(6)\n\n \"8421.39.90\n\n 8421.39.90 10\n\n8421.39.90 90\n\n - - - Other:\n\n  - - - -    With stainless steel\nhousing,  and with\ninlet and outlet tube\nbores with inside\ndiameters not\nexceeding 1.3 cm\n\n - - - -     Other\n\nkg\n\nkg\n\n5%\n\n5%\n\n  0%\n\n 0%\";\n\nP.U. (A)\n\n(g) in relation to subheadings 8518.21.10 00,  8518.21.90 00, 8518.22.10 00,\n8518.22.90 00, 8518.30.59 00,  8518.30.90 00, 8518.40.20 00, 8518.40.30 00,\n8518.40.40 00, 8518.40.90 00, 8518.50.10 00, 8518.50.20 00 and 8518.50.90 00,\nin column (5),  by substituting for the words \"12%\" the words \"6%\";\n\n(h) in relation to subheadings 8519.81.30 00 and 8519.8 9.90 30 ,  in column (5),\nby substituting for the words \"5%\" the words \"0%\";\n\n(i) in relation to subheadings 8527.13.90 00, 8527.19.90 00,  8527.21.00 1 0,\n8527.29.00 00, 8527.92.20 00 and  8527.99.20 00 , in column (5),\nby substituting for the words \"10%\" the words \"5%\";\n\n(j) in relation to subheading 8527.91.90 00,  in column (5),  by substituting for the\nwords \"7%\" the words \"5%\";\n\n(k) in relation to subheadings 8528.49.10 00 and 8528.49.20 00 ,  in column (5),\nby substituting for the words \"12%\" the words \"6%\";\n\n(l) in relation to subheadings 8528.71.11 00 and 8528.71.91 00 ,  in column (5),\nby substituting for the words \"15%\" the words \"7%\";\n\n(m) in relation to subheadings 8536.30.10 00, 8536.30.90 00, 8536.50.33 00 ,\n8536.50.40 00,  8536.50.51 00, 8536.50.61 00 and 8536.50.99 20, in column (5),\nby substituting for the words \"11%\" the words \"9%\";\n\n(n) in relation to subheading 8539.39.30 10 ,  in column (5),  by substituting for\nthe words \"10%\" the words \"7%\";\n\n(o) in relation to subheadings 9010.50.10 00 and 9010.50.90 00,  in column (5),\nby substituting for the words \"15%\" the words \"12%\";\n\n(p) in relation to subheadings 9015.10.90 00, 9015.20.00 00, 9015.40.00 00,\n9015.80.10 00 and 9015.80.90 00 ,  in column (5),  by substituting for\nthe words \"5%\" the words \"0%\";\n\nP.U. (A)\n\n(q) in relation to subheading 9028.90.10 00 ,  in column (5),  by substituting for\nthe words \"18%\" the words \"15%\"; and\n\n(r) in relation to subheading 9504.30.10 9 0,  in column (5),  by substituting for\nthe words \"22%\" the words \"18%\".\n\nMade 17 December 2018\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-3 Klt.6 Sk.33; Perb. (C)0.401/1(SJ.1)JLD.3; PN(PU2)338/XLVIII]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMinister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 11(2) of the Customs Act 1967]"
    },
