 "MY-H4453": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4453",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Customs (Import Licence Fee for\nMotor Vehicle) (Amendment) Regulations 2019.\n\n (2) These Regulations are deemed to have come into operation\non 1 January 2017 except for paragraph 2(a).\n\n(3) Paragraph 2(a) is deemed to have come into operation on 1 April 2017.\n\nAmendment of regulation 2"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Customs (Import Licence Fee for Motor Vehicle) Regulations 2016\n[P.U. (A) 370/2016 ], which are referred to as the \"principal Regulations\" in these\nRegulations, are amended in subregulation 2(1)—\n\n(a) by substituting for the words \"Custom s (Prohibition of Import s)\nOrder 2012 [ P.U. (A) 490/2012 ]\" the words \"Custom s (Prohibition of\nImports) Order 2017 [P.U. (A) 103/2017]\"; and\n\n(b) by substituting for paragraph (a) the following paragraph:\n\n\"(a) in relation to the first thirty five thousand import licence s\napproved for the whole of the open AP companies during the\nvalidity period of the current year's AP allocation, ten thousand\nringgit for each unit of the motor vehicle imported by the open\nAP company;\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 5"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Regulation 5 of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting for the words\n\"in the form of a banker's draft\" the words \"in a manner to be determined by\nthe  Secretary General of the Ministry of International Trade and Industry\".\n\nMade 4 November 2019\n[SULIT. KE. HF(152)860/01 –2 Klt. 2(26 ); MOF.TAX(S)700-2/1/16 JLD.2 (20) ;\nPN(PU2)338/LIII]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMinister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H4454": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4454",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. These regulations may be cited as the Control of Tobacco Product\n\n(Amendment) Regulations 2020.\n\nAmendment of regulation 2"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Control of Tobacco Product Regulations 2004 [P.U. (A) 324/2004], which are\n\nreferred to as the \"principal Regulations\" in these Regulations, are amended\n\nin regulation 2—\n\n(a) by inserting before the definition of \"retail selling price\" the following\n\ndefinition:\n\n‘ \"cigar\" means a roll of tobacco wrapped in a leaf tobacco or in\n\na substance that contains a tobacco;';\n\n(b) in the definition of \"carton\"—\n\n(i) by substituting for the word \"rectangular\" the word \"cuboid\"; and\n\n(ii) by substituting for the word \"cigarette\" the words \"tobacco product\";\n\n(c) by substituting for the definition of \"packet\" with the following definition:\n\n‘ \"packet\" means a pack which is cuboid in shape for cigarette,\n\nor a pack which is cylindrical, cuboid or package in shape for tobacco\n\nproduct other than cigarette, as the case may be;'; and\n\n(d) in the definition of \"cigarette\", by substituting for the words \"rolled up in\n\na single or more wrapper of paper, and which is capable of being\n\nimmediately used for smoking\" the words \"rolled up in any wrapper, and\n\nwhich is used for smoking\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 8A"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Regulation 8A of the principal Regulations is amended—\n\n(a) in subregulation (5A), by inserting after the words \"subregulation 8C(2)\"\n\nthe words \"and 8F(2)\"; and\n\n(b) in subregulation (5B), by substituting for the words \"of cigarette and\n\ncarton\" the words \"or carton of tobacco product\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 8C"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Regulation 8C of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting\n\nsubregulation (1) with the following subregulation:\n\n\"(1) No person shall sell or offer for sale any packet of twenty sticks of cigarettes\n\nbelow the minimum price of twelve ringgit.\".\n\nNew regulation 8F"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. The principal Regulations are amended by inserting after regulation 8E the\n\nfollowing regulation:\n\n\"Minimum cigar price"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 8,
    "text": {
     "en": "8F. (1) No person shall sell or offer for sale any cigar below the minimum price\n\nof twelve ringgit for each packet.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subregulation (1)—\n\n(a) any cigar with an approved retail selling price less than the\n\nminimum price specified in subregulation (1), shall be sold at\n\nthe retail selling price of the minimum price; and\n\n(b) any cigar at an approved retail selling price equivalent to or\n\nmore than the minimum price specified in subregulation (1),\n\nshall be sold at the approved retail selling price.\n\n(3) Any person who contravenes this regulation commits an offence and\n\nshall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or\n\nto imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both.\".\n\nMade 13 November 2020\n\n[KKM.PUU(R)(PU2)/TC/4; PN(PU2)418/XXVIII]\n\n DATO' SRI DR ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 8"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
