     "en": "2. The Trade Descriptions (Marking of Safety Glass for Motor Vehicles ) Order 2017\n[P.U. (A) 295/2017 ], which is referred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order,\nis amende d in subparagraph 1(2) by substituting for the words \"1 May 2018\" the\nwords \"1 October 2018\".\n\nAmendment of paragraph 3"
