    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Co-operative Societies\n(Assumption of Control  of Koperasi Automobil Kuching Sarawak Berhad )\n(Appointment and Revocation of Appointment) Order 2020.\n\n (2) Paragraph 4 comes into operation on 30 November 2020.\n\nAssumption of control"
    },
