 "MY-H4576": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4576",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pesticides (Exemption) (No. 3)\n\nOrder 2020.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 December 2020.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Minister exempts LBSF ENERGY SOLUTION SDN. BHD.\n\n(Company No. 325455-P) from the prohibition under paragraph 13(1)(b) of the Act for\n\nthe purpose of importing a pesticide containing ethylene oxide as its active ingredient.\n\nCondition of exemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the condition that the imported\n\npesticide shall be used solely for the sterilization of medical devices.\n\nMade 19 November 2020\n\n[KP/LA/8/11 Jld 10; PN(PU2)275/XXIII]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. RONALD KIANDEE\n\nMinister of Agriculture and Food Industries"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H4577": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4577",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Stamp Duty  (Exemption) (No. 8)\nOrder 2021.\n\n (2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 2 February 2021.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1)  An instrument of loan or a financing agreement relating to the loan\nor financing facility  executed between a small and medium enterprises and\na financial institution is, on application, exempted from stamp duty.\n\n(2) The exemption under subparagraph (1) shall apply to the said instrument\nwhich is execut ed pursuant to a letter of offer issued by the financial institution\non or after 2 February 2021 but not later than 31 December 2021.\n\n(3) The applicat ion for  an exemption under sub paragraph (1) shall be\naccompanied by a letter of offer from  the financial institution  to the small and medium\nenterprises which states the approval of the loan or financing facility.\n\n(4) In this paragraph —\n\n(a) \"financial institution\" has the same meaning as that assigned to\n\"banker\" in section 2 of the Act, and any person prescribed\nas a financial institution by the Minister under subsection 2(1)\nof the Central Bank of Malaysia Act 2009 [Act 701] for the purposes\nof section 49 of the Act;\n\n(b) \"loan or finan cing facility\" means a Disaster Relief Facility 2021\napproved under Bank Negara Malaysia's Fund for small and\nmedium enterprises; and\n\n(c) \"small and medium enterprises\" means enterprises as may be\ndetermined by the National Small and Medium Enterprises\nDevelopment Council established under section 2A of the Small and\nMedium Industries Development Corporation Act 1995 [Act 539].\n\nMade 4 August 2021\n[MOF.TAX(S) 700 -1/3/11 JLD.2; LHDN.AY.A.600-12/1/7(29)-133; PN(PU2)159/XXXIV]\n\n                 TENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n                                   Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H4579": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4579",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This Order may be cited as the Universiti Sains Malaysia (Engineering Campus)\n\n(Nibong Tebal Branch) Order 2024.\n\nEstablishment of Campus"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Upon the coming into operation of this Order—\n\n(a) a Campus of the Universiti Sains Malaysia is established;\n\n(b) the name of the Campus referred to in subparagraph (a)is \"Universiti Sains\n\nMalaysia— Engineering Campus (Nibong Tebal Branch);\n\n(c) the Campus referred to in subparagraph (a) is located at PT 341,\n\nH.S.(D) 9302, PT 342, H.S.(D) 9303 and PT Plot 1, Geran H.S.(D) 43135\n\nMukim 9, District of Seberang Perai Selatan, Pulau Pinang; and\n\n(d) School of Aerospace Engineering, School of Civil Engineering, School of\n\nMaterials and Mineral Resources Engineering, School of Electrical and\n\nElectronic Engineering, School of Chemical Engineering, School of\n\nMechanical Engineering, River Engineering and Urban Drainage Research\n\nCentre, Science & Engineering Research Center and any other School,\n\nCentre, Academy and Institute which are established for the purposes of\n\nthe Campus referred to in subparagraph (a) shall be located in the Campus.\n\nMade 3 October 2024\n\n[KPT.PUU(S).100-1/21/1(11); PN(PU2)75/JLD.14]\n\nDATO' SERI DIRAJA DR. ZAMBRY BIN ABD KADIR\n\nMinister of Higher Education"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
