 "MY-H4599": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4599",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Renewable Energy\n\n(Amendment of Schedule) (No. 2) Order 2014.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 January 2015.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Schedule to the Renewable Energy Act 2011 is amended by substituting for\n\nthe item \"Solar photovoltaic\" and other items relating to it the following items:\n\nFirst\n\nColumn\n\nSecond Column Third\n\nColumn\n\nFourth Column Fifth\n\nColumn\n\nRenewable\n\nresource\n\nDescription of qualifying\n\nrenewable energy installation\n\nFeed-in\n\ntariff rate\n\n(in ringgit\n\nper\n\nkilowatt\n\nhour)\n\nEffective period\n\n(commencing\n\nfrom the\n\nfeed-in tariff\n\ncommencement\n\ndate)\n\nAnnual\n\ndegression\n\nrate\n\n\"Solar\n\nphotovoltaic\n\n(a) Renewable energy installation\n\nhaving an installed capacity\n\nof:\n\nBasic\n\nfeed-in\n\ntariff\n\n(i) up to and including\n\n4 kilowatts (individual)\n\n0.9166 21 years 10%\n\n(ii) above 4 kilowatts,\n\nand up to and\n\nincluding 12 kilowatts\n\n(individual)\n\n0.8942 21 years 10%\n\n(iii) up to and\n\nincluding 4 kilowatts\n\n(non-individual)\n\n0.9166 21 years 10%\n\n(iv) above 4 kilowatts,\n\nand up to and\n\nincluding 24 kilowatts\n\n(non-individual)\n\n0.8942 21 years 10%\n\n(v) above 24 kilowatts,\n\nand up to and\n\nincluding 72 kilowatts\n\n(non-individual)\n\n0.7222 21 years 15%\n\n(vi) above 72 kilowatts,\n\nand up to and\n\nincluding 1 megawatt\n\n(non-individual)\n\n0.6977 21 years 15%\n\n(vii) above 1 megawatt, and\n\nup to and including\n\n10 megawatts\n\n(non-individual)\n\n0.5472 21 years 20%\n\n(viii) above 10 megawatts,\n\nand up to and including\n\n30 megawatts\n\n(non-individual)\n\n0.4896 21 years 20%\n\n(b) Renewable energy installation\n\nhaving any one or more of the\n\nfollowing criteria in addition\n\nto (a) above:\n\nBonus\n\nfeed-in\n\ntariff rate\n\nin addition\n\nto basic\n\nfeed-in\n\ntariff rate\n\n(i) use as installation in\n\nbuilding or building\n\nstructures\n\n+ 0.1722 21 years 20%\n\n(ii) use as building\n\nmaterials\n\n+ 0.1656 21 years 20%\n\n(iii) use of locally\n\nmanufactured or\n\nassembled solar\n\nphotovoltaic modules\n\n+ 0.05 21 years 0%\n\n(iv) use of locally\n\nmanufactured or\n\nassembled solar\n\ninverters\n\n+ 0.05 21 years 0%\".\n\nMade 4 December 2014\n\n[KeTTHA(BP)9/14 Klt. 5; PN(PU2)693/V]\n\nDATUK SERI PANGLIMA DR. MAXIMUS JOHNITY ONGKILI\n\nMinister of Energy, Green Technology and Water"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H4602": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4602",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1) This order may be cited as the Promotion of Investments\n(Determination of Assets under section 29 B in respect of MSC Status Companies)\n(Revocation) Order 2018.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 1 January 2019.\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Promotion of Investments (Determination of Assets under  section 29B in\nrespect of MSC Status Companies) Order 2001 [P.U. (A) 50/2001] which is referred to as\nthe \"principal Order\" in this Order is revoked.\n\nSavings"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3.  Any investment tax allowance given under section 29B of the Act to any MSC\nstatus companies immediately before the coming o peration of this Order shall, on the\ncoming into operation of this Order, be continued as if the principal Order had not been\nrevoked by this Order.\n\nMade 19 December 2018\n[MITI(S).700-3/1/16 JLD. 2 (6); PN(PU2)451/VII]\n\nIGNATIUS DARELL LEIKING\nMinister of International Trade and Industry\n\nConcurred 20 December 2018\n[0.3865/73 (SJ. 133) (5); PN(PU2)451/VII]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMinister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H4604": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4604",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pesticides (Exemption) (No. 5)\n\nOrder 2020.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 December 2020.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Minister exempts TOMOE MALAYSIA SDN. BHD. (Company No. 1164031-V)\n\nfrom the prohibition under paragraph 13(1)(b) of the Act for the purpose of importing\n\na pesticide containing ethylene oxide as its active ingredient.\n\nCondition of exemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the condition that the imported\n\npesticide shall be used solely for the sterilization of medical devices.\n\nMade 19 November 2020\n\n[KP/LA/8/11 Jld 10; PN(PU2)275/XXIII]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. RONALD KIANDEE\n\nMinister of Agriculture and Food Industries"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
