 "MY-H4702": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4702",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pesticides (Exemption) (No. 5) Order 2019.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 15 December 2019.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Subject to paragraph 3, the Minister exempts Agricultural Chemicals (M) Sdn. Bhd.\n\n(Company No. 008938-M) from the prohibition under paragraph 13(1)(b) of the Act\n\nfor the purpose of manufacturing a pesticide and the requirement under\n\nparagraph 15(2)(a) of the Act for the purpose of application for a licence to\n\nmanufacture a pesticide.\n\nCondition of exemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the condition that the pesticide\n\nshall be manufactured under an agreement for the registrant of the pesticide.\n\nMade 5 December 2019\n\n[KP/LA/483/11 Jld 10; PN(PU2)275/XXII]\n\nDATUK SERI SALAHUDDIN BIN AYUB\n\nMinister of Agriculture and Agro-Based Industry"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
