    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Federal Roads (Private Management)\n\n(Collection of Tolls) (Penang Bridge) (Amendment) Order 2018.\n\n (2) Subparagraph 2(a) is deemed to have come into operation\n\non 12 January 2012.\n\n(3) Subparagraph 2(b) is deemed to have come into operation on 1 June 2018.\n\n(3) Paragraph 3 is deemed to have come into operation on 15 January 2011.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2"
    },
