 "MY-H4812": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4812",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Stamp Duty (Exemption)\n(No. 7) Order 2024.\n\n (2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2022.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The Minister exempts the instrument of loan or financing agreement\nfor the High Tech  and Green Facility approved under the Bank Negara  Malaysia's Fund\nfor Small and Medium Enterprises executed between a participating  financial institution\nand small and medium enterprises from stamp duty.\n\n(2) The exemption under subparagraph (1) shall apply to the said instrument\nwhich is executed pursuant to a letter of offer issued by the participating\nfinancial institution  on or after 1 January 2022 but not later than 31 December 2023.\n\n(3) The exemption under subparagraph (1) shall be accompanied by a letter of\noffer from the participating financial institution to the small and medium enterprises\nwhich states the approval of the loan or financing facility.\n\n(4) In this paragraph—\n\n(a) \"participating financial institution\" means—\n\n(i) Affin Bank Berhad;\n\n(ii) Affin Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(iii) Alliance Bank Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(iv) Alliance Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(v) AmBank (M) Berhad;\n\n(vi) AmBank Islamic Berhad;\n\n(vii) Bank Kerjasama Rakyat Malaysia Berhad (Bank Rakyat);\n\n(viii) Bank Muamalat Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(ix) Bank of China (Malaysia) Berhad;\n\n(x) Bank Pertanian Malaysia Berhad (Agrobank);\n\n(xi) CIMB Bank Berhad;\n\n(xii) CIMB Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(xiii) Export-Import Bank of Malaysia Berhad (EXIM Bank);\n\n(xiv) HSBC Bank Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(xv) HSBC Amanah Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(xvi) Hong Leong Bank Berhad;\n\n(xvii) Hong Leong Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(xviii) Malayan Banking Berhad;\n\n(xix) Maybank Islamic Berhad;\n\n(xx) MBSB Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxi) OCBC Bank (Malaysia) Berhad;\n\n(xxii) OCBC Al-Amin Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxiii) Public Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxiv) Public Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxv) RHB Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxvi) RHB Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxvii) Small Medium Enterprise Development Bank Malaysia\nBerhad (SME Bank);\n\n                                        (xxviii) Standard Chartered Bank Malaysia Berhad;\n\n                                        (xxix)   United Overseas Bank (Malaysia) Bhd.;\n\n(b)  \"small and medium enterprises\" has the meaning assigned to\nit in section 2 of the Small and Medium Enterprises Corporation\nMalaysia Act 1995 [Act 539].\n\nMade 12 November 2024\n[MOF.TAX.700-3/2/138; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-326; PN(PU2)159/JLD.37]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\n                                                 Finance Minister II"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H4814": {
  "lawId": "MY-H4814",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Immigration (Exemption) (No. 13)\n\nOrder 2026.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 2 October 2026.\n\nDefinition"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order—\n\n\"Republic of Singapore information technology support staff\" means\n\ninformation technology support staff employed by a vendor who is responsible for\n\nthe operation and maintenance of the Republic of Singapore information systems\n\nunder a contract with the Government of the Republic of Singapore;\n\n\"designated area\" has the meaning assigned to it in the Johor Bahru–Singapore\n\nRapid Transit System Link Act 2026 [Act 884];\n\n\"Bukit Chagar Station\" has the meaning assigned to it in the Johor Bahru–Singapore\n\nRapid Transit System Link Act 2026.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Minister exempts any Republic of Singapore information technology support\n\nstaff performing official duties in the designated area at Bukit Chagar Station from\n\nthe application of a valid Pass issued under paragraph 6(1)(c) of the Act.\n\nConditions of exemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any Republic of Singapore information technology support staff who is exempted\n\nunder paragraph 3 is subject to the following conditions:\n\n(a) the entry into Malaysia shall be to the designated area at Bukit Chagar\n\nStation;\n\n(b) possesses a valid travel document at all times;\n\n(c) for each entry into Malaysia to the designated area at Bukit Chagar Station,\n\nthe Republic of Singapore information technology support staff who\n\nis exempted shall, upon the request by the Government of Malaysia\n\nauthorities, produce his security pass or other evidence of identity for\n\nverification while performing official duties at Bukit Chagar Station; and\n\n(d) for each entry into Malaysia, the Republic of Singapore information\n\ntechnology support staff who is exempted is only permitted to remain\n\ntemporarily in Malaysia for a period of not more than thirty days.\n\nMade 1 October 2026\n\n[KDN.IM.S.600-2/1/11 Jld. 35 (17); PN(PU2)100/JLD.20]\n\n DATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\n Minister of Home Affairs"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
