     "en": "2. The Income Tax (Deduction for the Sponsorship of Hallmark Event) Rules 2016\n[P.U. (A) 165/2016 ], which are referred to as the \"principal Rules\" in these Rules,\nare amended in paragraph 3(1) (a) by substituting fo r the word s \"31 December 2022\"\nthe words \"31 December 2024\".\n\nAmendment of rule 4"
