     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the National Skills Developme nt\n(Waiver of Fee to National Dual Training System Trainee a t Malaysia n Prison\nDepartment) Regulations 2017.\n\n (2) These Regulations are deemed to have come into operation\non 1 May 2017.\n\nWaiver of fee"
