     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Customs (Value s of Imported\nCompletely Built-Up Motor Vehicles) (New) (Amendment) (No. 2) Order 2013.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 12 December 2013.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
