     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Determination of Maximum Price) (No. 8) Order 2013.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for  the period from 23 December 2013 to\n27 December 2013.\n\nMaximum producer price"
