 "MY-H5176": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5176",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Companies (Prescribed Interest)\nRegulations 2011.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 15 November 2011.\n\nInterpretation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In these Regulations—\n\n \"Act\" means the Companies Act 1965;\n\n \"prescribed interest\", in relation to an interest referred to in subsection 6A(6) of\nthe Act, means an interest that shall be disregarded as a deemed interest for the\npurpose of paragraph 6A(9)(d) of the Act; and\n\n \"securities borrowing and lending transaction\" has t he meaning assigned to it in\nthe Securities Borrowing and Lending Guidelines issued by the Securities Commission.\n\nPrescribed interest"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. An interest of a person under subsection 6A(6) of the Act arising from a\nsecurities borrowing and lending transaction is a prescribed interest."
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. For the purpose of regulation 3, a person means—\n\n(a) a lender in a securities borrowing and lending arrangement; or\n\n(b) a borrower in a securities borrowing and lending arrangement, provided\nthat the borrower shall not keep the borr owed securities for more than 3\nbusiness days.\n\nMade 1 November 2011\n[KPDN(BUU)(PU2)26/5/58); PN(PU2)4/VIII]\n\nDATO'  SRI ISMAIL SABRI BIN YAAKOB\nMinister of Domestic Trade,\nCo-operatives and Consumerism"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
