 "MY-H5184": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5184",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Ministers of the Federal Government\n\n(No. 3) (Amendment) (No. 6) Order 2022.\n\n(2) Subparagraphs 2(a), (d) and (e) and subsubparagraph 2(b)(ii) are deemed\n\nto have come into operation on 1 November 2022.\n\n(3) Subparagraph 2(c) and subsubparagraph 2(b)(i) are deemed to have\n\ncome into operation on 4 November 2022.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Ministers of the Federal Government (No. 3) Order 2021 [P.U. (A) 383/2021]\n\nis amended in the Schedule—\n\n(a) in respect of the Prime Minister's Department, by substituting for\n\nthe words \"30 August 2021\" in the \"Style and Title/Date of Appointment\"\n\ncolumn appearing against the words \"Senator Tuan Idris bin Haji Ahmad\"\n\nthe words \"For the period from 30 August 2021 to 1 November 2022\";\n\n(b) in respect of the Ministry of Education—\n\n(i) by substituting for the words \"30 August 2021\" in the\n\n\"Style and Title/Date of Appointment\" column appearing against\n\nthe words \"Senator Datuk Dr. Mohd Radzi bin Md Jidin\" the words\n\n\"For the period from 30 August 2021 to 4 November 2022\";\n\n(ii) by substituting for the words \"30 August 2021\" in the\n\n\"Style and Title/Date of Appointment\" column appearing against\n\nthe words \"Senator Dato' Dr. Mah Hang Soon\" the words\n\n\"For the period from 30 August 2021 to 1 November 2022\";\n\n(c) in respect of the Ministry of Finance, by substituting for the words\n\n\"30 August 2021\" in the \"Style and Title/Date of Appointment\"\n\ncolumn appearing against the words\n\n\"Senator Tengku Datuk Seri Utama Zafrul bin Tengku Abdul Aziz\"\n\nthe words \"For the period from 30 August 2021 to 4 November 2022\";\n\n(d) in respect of the Ministry of International Trade and Industry,\n\nby substituting for the words \"30 August 2021\" in the\n\n\"Style and Title/Date of Appointment\" column appearing against\n\nthe words \"Senator Datuk Lim Ban Hong\" the words\n\n\"For the period from 30 August 2021 to 1 November 2022\"; and\n\n(e) in respect of the Ministry of National Unity, by substituting for\n\nthe words \"30 August 2021\" in the \"Style and Title/Date of Appointment\"\n\ncolumn appearing against the words\n\n\"Senator Tuan Wan Ahmad Fayhsal bin Wan Ahmad Kamal\" the words\n\n\"For the period from 30 August 2021 to 1 November 2022\".\n\nMade 25 November 2022\n\n[BKPP.R.700-1/2/6 Jld. 2; PN(PU2)18/Jld. 38]\n\nBy Command\n\nTAN SRI DATO' SERI MOHD ZUKI BIN ALI\n\nSecretary to the Cabinet"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
