     "en": "2. The Schedule to the Optical Regulations 1994 [P.U. (A) 210/1994] is amended—\n\n(a) by substituting for Form 14 the following form:\n\n\"Form 14\n\n[Regulation 22]\n\nOPTICAL ACT 1991\n\n[Subsection 32(2)]\n\nOPTICAL REGULATIONS 1994\n\nANNUAL PRACTISING CERTIFICATE FOR OPTICIAN\n\nYEAR __________\n\nIT IS HEREBY CERTIFIED THAT:\n\n(b) by substituting for Form 15 the following form:\n\nName :\n\nIdentity Card No./Passport No. :\n\nFull Registration No. :\n\nPermit to Prescribe and Dispense Contact :\n\nLens No.\n\nAnnual Practising Certificate No. :\n\n is a fully registered optician and authorized to practise as an optician subject to the\n\nfollowing conditions:\n\n(a)\n\n(b)\n\n(c)\n\ncommencing on ……………………… and ending on ………………………………………….. at—\n\n(a)\n\nbeing the principal place of practice, and at—\n\n(b)\n\nbeing the other place of practice.\n\nDate : ……………………. ………………………………………….\n\nRegistrar\n\nFee of RM ……………… has been paid.\n\nReceipt No. : ……………….. dated\n\n…………………..\"; and\n\n\"Form 15\n\n[Regulation 22]\n\nOPTICAL ACT 1991\n\n[Subsection 32(2)]\n\nOPTICAL REGULATIONS 1994\n\nANNUAL PRACTISING CERTIFICATE FOR OPTOMETRIST\n\nYEAR __________\n\nName :\n\nIdentity Card No./Passport No. :\n\nRegistration No. :\n\nAnnual Practising Certificate No. :\n\nis a fully registered optometrist and authorized to practise as an optometrist subject\n\nto the following conditions:\n\n(a)\n\n(b)\n\n(c)\n\ncommencing on……………………… and ending on ………………………………………….. at—\n\n(a)\n\nbeing the principal place of practice, and at—\n\n(b)\n\nbeing the other place of practice.\n\nIT IS HEREBY CERTIFIED THAT;\n\nDate : ……………………. ………………………………………….\n\nRegistrar\n\nMade 2017\n\nMade 13 November 2017\n\n[KKM.600-1/3/74/JLD. 2 (10); PN(PU2)503/VII]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\n Minister of Health\n\nFee of RM ……………… has been paid.\n\nReceipt No. : ……………….. dated\n\n…………………..\"."
