 "MY-H5259": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5259",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Universiti Tun Hussein Onn Malaysia\n\n(Campus) (Pagoh Branch) Order 2016.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 January 2017.\n\nEstablishment of Campus"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Upon the coming into force of this Order—\n\n(a) a Campus of the Universiti Tun Hussein Onn Malaysia is established;\n\n(b) the name and style of the Campus is \"Universiti Tun Hussein Onn Malaysia—\n\nCampus (Pagoh Branch)\";\n\n(c) the Campus is located at H.S. (D) 36669, PTD 14424, Mukim Jorak,\n\nDistrict of Muar, State of Johor; and\n\n(d) the Faculty of Engineering Technology, the Faculty of Science, Technology\n\nand Human Development, the Centre for Graduate Studies, the Centre for\n\nDiploma Studies, and any other Faculty as establish are located in the\n\nCampus.\n\nMade 14 December 2016\n\n[KPM (PUU)S; PN(PU2)75/XII]\n\n DATO' SERI IDRIS BIN JUSOH\n\n Minister of Higher Education"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H5260": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5260",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 9) Order 2017.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 8 December 2017.\n\nApplication"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. This Order shall apply to—\n\n(a) the Short Term  Revolving Credit Facility obtained or to be obtained by\nPrasarana Malaysia Berhad  (formerly know n as Syarikat Prasarana\nNegara Berhad) , in the aggregate principal amount not exceeding\none billion nine hundred fourteen million ringgit (RM1,914,000,000.00);\nand\n\n(b) the guarantee provided or to be provided by the Government of Malaysia\nin relation to the facility referred to in subsubparagraph (a).\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53] by any of the following\nindividual or entity in respect of any money payable under any agreement, note,\ninstrument and document in relation  to the facility and guarantee referred to  in\nparagraph 2 shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) Prasarana Malaysia Berhad  to which the Loans Guarantee\n(Bodies Corporate)  Act 1965 applies by virtue of the Loans Guarantee\n(Declaration of  Bodies Corporate)  (Syarikat Prasarana Negara Berhad )\nOrder 2001 [P.U. (A) 351/2001]; or\n\n(b) any party to any agreement, note, instrument and document in relation to\nthe facility and guarantee referred to in paragraph 2 , including any party\nto whom such agreement, note, instrument and document are transferred\nor assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any stamp  duty pa yable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instr ument and document in relation  to the facility and guarantee\nreferred to in paragraph 2 shall be remitted in full.\n\nMade 6 December 2017\n[KK/SID/(S)845/1/1 Jld. 3(4); PN(PU2)232/XIII]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H5261": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5261",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1)     This order may be cited as the Stamp Duty ( Exemption) (No. 7)\nOrder 2018.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 January 2019.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1)  Subject to subparagraph s (2), (3) and (4) , all instrument of transfer\nexecuted in relation to the purchase of only one unit of residential property the value of\nwhich is more than three hundred thousand ringgit (RM300,000.00) but not more than\none million ringgit  (RM 1,000,000.00) by an individual shall be exempted from\nstamp duty.\n\n (2) The exemption under subparagraph (1) shall only be granted if—\n\n(a) the sale and purchase agreement for the purchase of the\nresidential property is executed on or after 1 Ja nuary 2019 but not\nlater than 30 June 2019;\n\n(b) the sale and  purchase agreement for the purchase of the\nresidential property is between the individual and a property\ndeveloper; and\n\n(c) the individual has never owned any residential property including\na residential property which is obtained by way of inheritance or\ngift, which is held either individually or jointly.\n\n(3) For the purpose of subparagraph (1), the value of the residential property\nshall be based on the market value.\n\n(4) The application for the exemption under subparagraph (1)  shall be\naccompanied by a sta tutory declaration under the Statutory Declarations Act  1960\n[Act 783 ] by the individual referred to in subparagraph (1) confirming that the\nindividual has never owned any residential property including a residential property\nwhich is obtained by way  of inheritance or gift, which is held either individually\nor jointly.\n\n (5) In this paragraph—\n\n\"residential property\" means a house, a condominium unit, an apartment\nor a flat purchased or obtained solely to be used as a dwelling house; and\n\n\"individual\" mea ns a  purchaser or co -purchaser who is a\nMalaysian citizen.\n\nMade 31 December 2018\n[Perb. CR(8.20)116/1-138(2019)SK.2/PN(PU2)159/XXXIII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. WAN AZIZAH BINTI DR. WAN ISMAIL\nDeputy Prime Minister\nexercising the functions of the Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
