 "MY-H5269": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5269",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Income Tax  (Deduction for Payment of\nPremium to Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation) Rules 2011.\n\n (2) These Rules are deemed to have effect f rom the assessment year of 2005\nuntil the assessment year of 2010 in respect of paragraph 2(a).\n\n (3) These Rules shall have effect for the assessment year of 2011 and subsequent\nyears of assessment in respect of paragraph 2(b).\n\nApplication"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. These Rules shall apply to a member institution who is—\n\n(a) a financial institution under section 37 of the Malaysia Deposit Insurance\nCorporation Act 2005 [Act 642]; or\n\n(b) a financial institution  under paragraph 36(1 )(b), a takaful operator or an\ninsurance company under s ubsection 36 (2) of the Malaysia Deposit\nInsurance Corporation Act 2011 [Act 720].\n\nDeduction"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) For the purpose of ascertaining the adjusted income of a member instituti on\nfrom its business for a basic  period for a year of assessment, there shall be allowed a\ndeduction of an amount equivalent to the first premium or annual premium paid by that\n\nmember institution to the Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation for that year of\nassessment.\n\n(2) For the purpose of subrule (1), the amount of deduction for premium paid\nshall be as determined under—\n\n(a) sections 42, 43 and 44 of the Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation\nAct 2005 in respect of a member institution under paragraph 2(a); or\n\n(b) sections 47, 48 and 49 or sections 71, 72 and 73 of the Malaysia Deposit\nInsurance Corporation Act 2011 in respect of a member institution\nunder paragraph 2(b).\n\nMade 3 November 2011\n[LHDN.01/35/(S)/42/51/286-39; Perbend. (8.09)248/40/7-1411(SK.1); PN(PU2)80/LXII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 154(2) of the Income Tax Act 1967]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H5270": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5270",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pensions Adjustment (Lowest Pension)\n\nOrder 2012.\n\n(2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2012.\n\nLowest pension, etc., for full service"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. For the purpose of calculating pension or other benefit granted and adjusted\n\nunder the Act or granted under any other written law and adjusted under the Act on the\n\nbasis of reckonable service of not less than twenty-five years—\n\n(a) the lowest amount of pension or derivative pension payable after\n\nadjustment shall not be less than eight hundred and twenty ringgit per\n\nmonth; and\n\n(b) the lowest amount of retiring allowance or derivative retiring allowance\n\npayable after adjustment shall not be less than three-quarters of eight\n\nhundred and twenty ringgit per month.\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Pensions Adjustment (Lowest Pension) Order 2009 [P.U. (A) 35/2009] is\n\nrevoked.\n\nMade 12 November 2012\n\n[JPA/PEN(R)228/43/8-3; PN(PU2)423/II]\n\n By Command,\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ALI BIN HAMSA\n\n Secretary to the Cabinet"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H5271": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5271",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Excise Duties (Exemption) Order 2013.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 January 2014.\n\nExemption from payment of excise duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Subject to paragraph 3, the persons specified in column (2) of Part I of the\n\nSchedule are exempted from the payment of excise duty on goods specified in\n\ncolumn (3) subject to the conditions specified in column (4).\n\n(2) A person designated in column (5) is subject to a condition to produce a\n\ncertificate signed by such designated person as described in Part II of the Schedule to\n\nthe proper officer of excise.\n\nExtent of exemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The exemption referred to in paragraph 2 shall be granted in full in respect of the\n\ngoods specified in column (3) of Part I of the Schedule unless otherwise provided in the\n\nconditions specified in column (4).\n\nTime when exemption operates"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. The exemption from payment of duty on such goods will take effect—\n\n(a) where the exemption is subject to the production of certificate, at the\n\ntime such certificate is approved by a proper officer of excise; and\n\n(b) in the case of other goods, when the proper officer of excise permits the\n\nrelease of the goods from the licensed warehouse or the licensed\n\npremises.\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. The Excise Duties (Exemption) Order 1977 [P.U. (A) 151/1977] is revoked."
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
