     "en": "1. This  order  may  be  cited  as  the  Customs  (Values) (Palm Oil) (No. 48 )\nOrder   2011   and   shall   have   effect   for   the  period   from   28   November   2011\nto 4 December 2011.\n\nLevy and payment of customs duties"
