     "en": "2. The Federal Roads (Private Management) (Collection of Tolls)\n(Seremban-Port Dickson Expressway) Order 2004 [ P.U. (A) 326/2004 ] is amended in\nthe heading of the First Schedule by substituting for the words \" 31 DECEMBER 2019\" the\nwords \"31 DECEMBER 2020\".\n\nMade 27 December 2019\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/1 Jld.21; PN(PU2)426/LXVIII]\n\nBARU BIAN\nMinister of Works"
