 "MY-H5384": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5384",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Stamp Duty (Exemption)\n(No. 14) Order 2021.\n\n (2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 15 December 2020.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The Minister exempts the instrument of loan or financing agreement for\nthe High Tech Facility – National Investment Aspirations  approved under Bank Negara\nMalaysia's Fund for small and medium enterprises executed between a participating\nfinancial institution with small and medium enterprises from stamp duty.\n\n (2) The exemption referred to in subparagraph (1) shall only apply if the\ninstrument of loan or financing agreement is executed pursuant to a letter of offer issued\non or after 15 December 2020 but not later than 31 December 2021.\n\n (3) The exemption under subparagraph (1) shall be subject to the condition\nthat the instrument of loan or financing agreement is accompanied by a letter of offer\nfrom the participating financial institution to the small and medium enterprises which\nstates the approval of the loan or financing facility.\n\n (4) In this paragraph—\n\n(a) \"participating financial institution\" means—\n\n(i) Affin Bank Berhad;\n(ii) Affin Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(iii) Alliance Bank Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(iv) Alliance Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(v) AmBank (M) Berhad;\n\n(vi) AmBank Islamic Berhad;\n\n(vii) Bank Kerjasama Rakyat Malaysia Berhad (Bank Rakyat);\n\n(viii) Bank Muamalat Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(ix) Bank of China (Malaysia) Berhad;\n\n(x) Bank Pertanian Malaysia Berhad (Agrobank);\n\n(xi) CIMB Bank Berhad;\n\n(xii) CIMB Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(xiii) Export-Import Bank of Malaysia Berhad (EXIM Bank);\n\n(xiv) HSBC Bank Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(xv) HSBC Amanah Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(xvi) Hong Leong Bank Berhad;\n\n(xvii) Hong Leong Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(xviii) Malayan Banking Berhad;\n(xix) Maybank Islamic Berhad;\n\n(xx) MBSB Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxi) OCBC Bank (Malaysia) Berhad;\n\n(xxii) OCBC Al-Amin Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxiii) Public Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxiv) Public Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxv) RHB Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxvi) RHB Islamic Bank Berhad;\n\n(xxvii)  Small Medium Enterprise Development Bank Malaysia\nBerhad (SME Bank);\n\n(xxviii) Standard Chartered Bank Malaysia Berhad;\n\n(xxix) United Overseas Bank (Malaysia) Bhd.; and\n\n(b) \"small and medium enterprises\" has the same meaning assigned to it\nunder section 2 of the Small and Medium Industries Development\nCorporation Act 1995 [Act 539].\n\nMade 6 October 2021\n[MOF.TAX.700-3/2/138; LHDN.AY.A.600-12/1/7(29)-120; PN(PU2)159/Jld. 35]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMinister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H5386": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5386",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering\n(Price Marking of Price-Controlled Goods) (No. 7) Order 2023.\n\n(2) This Order  has effect  for the  period from 23 December 2023\nto 27 December 2023.\n\nPrice marking"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Any person who sells or offers to sell any price-controlled goods published\nin the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering (Determination of Maximum Price)  (No. 16)\nOrder 20 23 [P.U. (A) 386/2023] shall affix a pink coloured label indicating the price\nper unit or per unit weight, the name describing such price-controlled goods and\nthe grade or quality, if any, of such price-controlled goods.\n\n (2) Any person who fails to comply with subparagraph (1) commits an\noffence and shall, on conviction, be liable—\n\n(a) if such person is a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding\ntwenty thousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent offence,\nto a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit; or\n\n(b) if such person is not a body corporate, to a fine not exceeding\nten thousand ringgit and, for a second or subsequent offence,\nto a fine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit.\n\nMade 14 December 2023\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)26/0.5001/1 Jld.12; PN(PU2)695/JLD. 34]\n\nDATUK ARMIZAN BIN MOHD ALI\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Cost of Living"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
