     "en": "2. The Immigration (Prohibition of Entry) Order 1963 [L.N. 227/1963] is amended in\n\nthe Schedule—\n\n(a) in paragraph C, by substituting for the words \"six years\" the words\n\n\"eighteen years\"; and\n\n(b) in paragraph E, by substituting for the words \"six years\" the words\n\n\"eighteen years\".\n\nMade 15 December 2017\n\n[KDN. IM. S. 600-1/3/6 (40); PN(PU2)100/XVII]\n\nDATO' SERI HAJI MUSTAFAR BIN HAJI ALI\n\nDirector General of Immigration Malaysia"
