    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Universities and University Colleges (Variation\n\nof and Addition to, the Constitution) (Universiti Sains Islam Malaysia)\n\n(Amendment) Order 2012.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    },
