    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Schedule to the Universities and University Colleges (Variation of and\nAddition  to,  the  Constitution) (Universiti  Tun  Hussein  Onn Malaysia) Order 2010\n[P.U. (A) 471/2010] is amended—\n\n(a) in item 3, in column (2), by substituting for the following particulars:\n\n \"(3) For the avoidance of doubt, the powers under subsection (1)\nmay be exercised by the Boar d, except the powers under paragraphs\n(1)(a), (b) , (c), (d), (e), (g), (l) and (o) which shall be exercised by the\nSenate.\"\n\nthe following particulars:\n\n \"(3) For the avoidance of doubt, the powers under subsection (1)\nmay be exercised by the Board, except  the powers under paragraphs\n(1)(a), (b) , (c), (d), (e), (g), (k) and (o) which shall be exercised by the\nSenate.\";\n\n(b) in item 13, in column (2)—\n\n(i) by substituting for the following particulars:\n\n\"(4)  Subject to the provisions of this Constitution, othe r\nterms and conditions of appointment of the Registrar, the Bursar,\nthe Chief Librarian and the Legal Adviser shall be determined by\nthe Board.\"\n\n   the following particulars:\n\n\"(4)  Subject to the provisions of this Constitution, the\nconditions of appoi ntment of the Registrar, the Bursar, the Chief\nLibrarian and the Legal Adviser shall be determined by the\nBoard.\"; and\n\n(ii) by inserting after  the following particulars:\n\n\"(4)  Subject to the provisions of this Constitution, other\nterms and conditions  of appointment of the Registrar, the Bursar,\nthe Chief Librarian and the Legal Adviser shall be determined by\nthe Board.\"\n\nthe following particulars:\n\n\"(5) A person appointed as the Registrar, the Bursar and the\nLegal Adviser shall, unless he resigns or vacates his office or his\nappointment is revoked, hold office for a period of not more than\nthree years and upon expiry of such period, the Registrar, the\nBursar and the Legal Adviser shall be eligible for reappointment.\n\n(6) A person appointed as the Chief  Librarian shall hold\noffice for a period as determined by the Board.\n\n(7) The appointment of the Registrar, the Bursar, the Chief\nLibrarian and the Legal Adviser may, at any time, be revoked by\nthe Board stating the reason for such revocation.\";\n\n(c) in item  15, by inserting before subitem \" –   subsection (3)\"  and the\nparticulars relating to it as specified in column (2) the following subitem\nand particulars relating to it:\n\n‘ –   subsection (1)  Substitute with the following:\n\n    \"(1)  The Authorities o f the University\nshall be the Board, the Senate, the\nManagement Committee of the University\nor by whatever name it may be referred to,\nthe Faculties, the Schools, the Centres, the\nAcademies, the Institutes, the Studies\nCommittee, the Selection Committees, the\nStudent Welfare Committee, the Students'\nComplaints Committee  and such other\nbodies as may be prescribed by statute as\nAuthorities of the University.\".';\n\n(d) in item 21, in column (2), by substituting for the following particulars:\n\n \"(8) The Senate shal l consider any matter transmitted to it by the\nBoard under subsection 20(3).\"\n\n the following particulars:\n\n \"(8) The Senate shall consider any matter transmitted to it by the\nBoard under subsection 20(2).\";\n\n(e) by deleting item 26 and the particulars relating to it as specified in column\n(2);\n\n(f) by inserting after item 27 and the particulars relating to it as specified in\ncolumn (2) the following item and the particulars relating to it:\n\n(g) in item 63, by inserting after subitem \" –  title\" and the particulars relating\nto it as specified in column (2) the following subitem and particulars\nrelating to it:\n\nMade 9 November 2012\n[KPT.U(S)100-1/2/1 Jld 9; PN(PU2)75M/V]\n\n                By Command,\n\nDATO' SERI MOHAMED KHALED BIN NORDIN\n                        Minister of Higher Education\n\" 27A.         Section 21A  Renumber as section 28A .\"; and\n‘–     paragraph 4\n\nSubstitute with the following:\n\n\"Filling of vacancies"
    },
