 "MY-H5628": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5628",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Excise (Amendment)\n\nRegulations 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 January 2020.\n\nAmendment of regulation 60A"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Excise Regulations 1977 [P.U. (A) 161/1977], are amended in\n\nregulation 60A—\n\n(a) by renumbering the existing provision as subregulation (1); and\n\n(b) by inserting after subregulation (1) as renumbered, the following\n\nsubregulation:\n\n\"(2) Subject to subregulation (1), if a claim for drawback under\n\nsection 19A of the Act is in relation to exportation or re-exportation\n\nin respect of the following goods, the goods shall be exported or\n\nre-exported by sea or air from free zones:\n\n(a) cigarettes;\n\n(b) tobacco products;\n\n(c) smoking pipes (including pipe bowls);\n\n(d) electronic cigarettes and similar personal electric\n\nvaporising devices; or\n\n(e) preparation of a kind used for smoking through\n\nelectronic cigarettes and electric vaporising device,\n\nin form of liquid or gel, not containing nicotine.\".\n\nMade 31 December 2020\n\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-1/1/7 JLD.6; PN(PU2)337/XXV]\n\nDATO' SRI TENGKU ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMinister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
