 "MY-H5677": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5677",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Income Tax (Exemption) Order 2015.\n\n(2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation from the year of\nassessment 2014.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Minister exempts an individual from the payment of income tax in respect of\ndeferred annuity withdrawn  by the individual  before reaching the age of fifty -five,\nwhich was contracted for by the individual with an insurer carrying on life business and\nlicensed under the Financial Services Act 2013 [ Act 758] or a takaful operator carrying\non family takaful business and licensed under t he Islamic Financial Services Act 2013\n[Act 759], for the period from 1 January 2014 until 31 May 2014.\n\nNon-application"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Section 109G of the Act shall not apply to the income exempted under this Order.\n\nMade 18 February 2015\n[Perb. CR  (8. 20)116/1-138 (2012) JLD.  6 (SK.  9); LHDN. 01/35/(S)/42/51 klt 20;\nPN(PU2) 80/LXXVII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 127(4) of the Income Tax Act\n1967]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H5678": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5678",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1)   This order may be cited as the Income Tax (Exemption) Order 2016.\n\n(2)  This Order shall apply for the year of assessment 2015.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) The Minister exempts an individual resident in Malaysia from the\npayment of income tax in the basis period for the year of ass essment in respect of his\nchargeable income referred to in subparagraph (2) provided that his total aggregate\nincome in the basis period for that year of assessment shall not exceed ninety six\nthousand ringgit.\n\n (2) The amount of chargeable income to be e xempted under\nsubparagraph (1) is two thousand ringgit.\n\nMade 15 February 2016\n[Perb. CR(8.09) 681/2 -61 (SJ.12) JLD.9(SK.II) ; LHDN.01/10.5-1/64-13;\nPN(PU2)80/LXXIX]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan R akyat pursuant to subsection 127(4 ) of the Income\nTax Act 1967]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H5679": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5679",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1)   This order may be cited as the Stamp Duty (Exemption) Order 2017.\n\n (2) This Order shall be deemed to have come into operation\non 1 January 2017.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Exemption from stamp duty shall be granted in respect of all instruments\nexecuted in relation to any home financing facility granted\n\n(a) under the Public Sector Home Financing Board Act 2015 [Act 767];\n\n(b) in relation to any application or approval deemed to have been\nissued, made or done under the Public Sector Home Financing\nBoard Act 2015  pursuant to subsection 46(1) of the Public Sector\nHome Financing Board  Act 2015;\n\n(c) in relation to any application or approval dealt with by the Public\nSector Home Financing Board pursuant to subsection 46(2) of the\nPublic Sector Home Financing Board Act 2015; or\n\n(d) under the Housing Loans Fund Act 1971 [ Act 42 ] repealed under\nsection 45 of the Public Sector Home Financing Board Act 2015.\n\n(2) In this paragraph\n\n \"Public Sector Home Financing Board\" means the Public Sector Home\nFinancing Board established under section 3 of the Public Sector Home Financing Board\nAct 2015;\n\n\"financing\" means  conventional loan or financing according to syariah,\nas the case may be.\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Stamp Duty (Exemption) (No. 7) Order 1994 [ P.U. (A) 144/ 1994] and\nthe Stamp Duty (Exemption) (No. 16) Order 1994 [P.U. (A) 338/1994] are revoked.\n\nMade 23 January 2017\n[Perb.CR(8.09)248/39/7-217JLD.12(SK.16); LHDN.01/35/(S)/42/68/231; PN(PU2)159/XXX]\n\nDATUK JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
