 "MY-H5788": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5788",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Malaysia Deposit I nsurance\nCorporation (Order of Priority for Payments of Different Categories of Islamic Deposits\nin the Winding Up of Deposit-taking Member) Regulations 2022.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 March 2022.\n\nOrder of priority for payments of different categories of Islamic deposits"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In the winding up of a deposit -taking member which has been approved under\nthe Financial Services Act 2013 [ Act 758 ] to carry on Islamic banking business or\na deposit -taking member that is an Islami c bank in or outside Malaysia, the order of\npriority of payments of Islamic deposits shall be as follows:\n\n(a) firstly, Islamic deposits as defined in subsection 2(1) of the Islamic\nFinancial Services Act 2013 [Act 759]; and\n\n(b) secondly, Islamic deposits deemed under section 288 of the Islamic\nFinancial Services Act 2013 to be Islamic deposits as defined\nin subsection 2(1) of the Islamic Financial Services Act 2013.\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation (Order of Priority for Payments of\nDifferent Categories of Islamic Deposits, Determination and Classification of Assets\nand Application of Disposal Proceeds of Asse ts in the W inding Up of\nDeposit-taking Member) Regulations 2017 [P.U. (A) 127/2017] are revoked.\n\nMade 24 January 2022\n[PIDM/PN/13/2022; PN(PU2)689/Jld. 7]\n\nTAN SRI DR. RAHAMAT BIVI YUSOFF\nChairman\nMalaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation\n\nApproved 17 February 2022\n[MOF(R)100-1/2/4 Jld. 4(2); PN(PU2)689/Jld. 7]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMinister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subs ection 2 09(4) of the\nMalaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation Act 2011]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
