 "MY-H5862": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5862",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Stamp Duty (Remission)\nOrder 2021.\n\n(2)  This Order is deemed to come into operation on 28 December 2018.\n\nRemission"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2.  (1)  The amount of stamp duty that is chargeable under subsubitem 22(1)(a) of\nthe First Schedule to the Act which is in excess of zero point one per center (0.1%) of any\nor sums of money in relation to any instrument of service agreement chargeable of duty\nunder that subsubitem executed on or after 28 December 2018 is remitted.\n\n(2)  For the purpose of subparagraph (1), the instrument of service agreement\nshall be an agreement executed by—\n\n(a) a main service provider with a person other than a Ruler of a State or\nthe Government of Malaysia or of any State or local authority\nawarding the undertaking; or\n\n(b) a sub-provider of service with the main service provider where the\nmain service provider has enter ed into an undertaking with\na Ruler of a State or the Government of Malaysia or of any State or\nlocal authority awarding the undertaking.\n\n(3)  Notwithstanding subparagraphs (1) and (2), where the main service\nprovider under subsubparagraph 2 (a) or the su b-provider of service under\nsubsubparagraph (2) (b) further executes an instrument of service agreement with\nanother sub-provider of service and so on, the amount of stamp duty that is chargeable\nupon that instrument under subsubitem 22(1) (a) of the First S chedule to the Act which\nis in excess of RM50.00 is remitted.\n\nMatters to be stated in the service agreement"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3.  For the purpose of subparagraph 2(3), the agreement by the sub -provider of\nservice or subsequent sub-provider of service shall state—\n\n(a) the names of the parties and the date of execution of the agreement\nreferred to in subsubparagraph 2(2)(a) or (b);\n\n(b) the subject matter of the agreement; and\n\n(c) that such agreement referred to in subsubparagraph 2(2) (a) or (b) had\nbeen duly stamped at a rate specified under subparagraph 2(1).\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4.  The Stamp Duty (Remission) (No. 4) Order 2010 [ P.U. (A) 476/2010] is revoked.\n\nMade 24 November 2021\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/11 Jld.3; PN(PU2)159/Jld. 35]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMinister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
