 "MY-H5889": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5889",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Customs Duties\n\n(Goods under the Malaysia-United Arab Emirates Comprehensive Economic\n\nPartnership Agreement) (Amendment) (No. 2) Order 2025.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 16 December 2025.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 3"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Customs Duties (Goods under the Malaysia-United Arab Emirates\n\nComprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement) Order 2025 [P.U. (A) 238/2025],\n\nwhich is referred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is amended in paragraph 3—\n\n(a) in subparagraph (2), by substituting for the words\n\n\"Customs Duties Order 2022 [P.U. (A) 114/2022]\" the words\n\n\"Customs Duties Order 2025 [P.U. (A) 384/2025]\"; and\n\n(b) in subparagraph (4), by substituting for the words\n\n\"Customs Duties Order 2022\" the words \"Customs Duties Order 2025\".\n\nSubstitution of paragraph 4"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The principal Order is amended by substituting for paragraph 4\n\nthe following paragraph:\n\n\"Calculation of import duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. For the purpose of determining the import duty levied\n\nunder paragraph 3, the import duty shall be calculated according to\n\nthe percentage of the value of the goods as prescribed\n\nunder the Customs (Rules of Valuation) Regulations 1999 [P.U. (A) 507/1999].\".\n\nSubstitution of paragraph 5\n\n4. The principal Order is amended by substituting for paragraph 5\n\nthe following paragraph:\n\n\"Classification of goods"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. The classification of goods specified in the First Schedule\n\nand the Second Schedule shall comply with the General Rules\n\nfor the Interpretation of the Harmonized System as specified\n\nin paragraph 4 of the Customs Duties Order 2025.\".\n\nMade 15 December 2025\n\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)670/30; MOF.TAX(R)700-2/2/30 JLD.3; PN(PU2)338/JLD.80]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMinister of Finance II\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 11(2) of the Customs Act 1967]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
