 "MY-H5953": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5953",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pesticides (Exemption) Order 2023.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 March 2023.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Subject to paragraph 3, the Minister exempts a person to manufacture\n\na pesticide for the purpose solely for non-local market usage from—\n\n(a) the requirement under section 7 of the Act for the purpose of application\n\nfor registration of the pesticide;\n\n(b) the prohibition under paragraph 13(1)(b) of the Act for the purpose of\n\nmanufacturing of the pesticide; and\n\n(c) the requirement under paragraph 15(2)(a) of the Act for the purpose\n\nof application for a licence to manufacture the pesticide.\n\nCondition of exemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the following conditions:\n\n(a) the active ingredient used is the same with the active ingredient\n\nfor the time being registered for the purpose of importation or\n\nmanufacturing; and\n\n(b) the manufacturer shall submit to the Board the annual report\n\nof manufacture for each of the pesticide before 31 of January\n\nof the following year.\n\n(2) The Minister may revoke the exemption under paragraph 2 if any condition\n\nunder subparagraph (1) is not complied with.\n\nMade 30 December 2022\n\n[KP/LA/8/11; PN(PU2)275/XXIII]\n\n DATUK SERI HAJI MOHAMAD BIN SABU\n\nMinister of Agriculture and Food Security"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
