     "en": "1. This  order  may  be  cited  as  the  Customs  (Values) (Palm Oil) (No. 51)\nOrder   2012   and   shall   have   effect   for  the  period  from  17  December  2012  to\n23 December 2012.\n\nLevy and payment of customs duties"
