 "MY-H5993": {
  "lawId": "MY-H5993",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Goods and Services Tax\n\n(Amendment) Regulations 2017.\n\n(2) Except regulation 4, these Regulations come into operation\n\non 1 January 2018.\n\n (3) Regulation 4 comes into operation on 1 October 2018.\n\nAmendment of regulation 39"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Goods and Services Tax Regulations 2014 [P.U. (A) 190/2014], which are\n\nreferred to as the \"principal Regulations\" in these Regulations, are amended in\n\nparagraph 39(3)(c) by deleting the words \"and 42\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 41"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Paragraph 41(j) of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting for the\n\nwords \"investment holding company\" the words \"company whose principal activity is\n\nthe holding of investment including properties, shares of other companies or loans\".\n\nAmendment of regulation 49"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Regulation 49 of the principal Regulations is amended—\n\n(a) in the shoulder note, by deleting the words \"local authority or\"; and\n\n(b) by deleting the words \"local authority or\" wherever appearing.\n\nAmendment of regulation 68"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. Regulation 68 of the principal Regulations is amended by substituting for\n\nsubregulation (1) the following subregulation:\n\n\"(1) Every application for tax refund under subsection 10(4), 17(6),\n\n18 (4) or 57(1) of the Act or subregulation 38(4), 46(5) or 71(2) shall be made—\n\n(a) by a registered person, by amending the return relating to\n\nthe refund;\n\n(b) by a non-registered person who has made a declaration,\n\nby amending the declaration relating to the refund; or\n\n(c) by any person other than the person referred to in\n\nparagraphs (a) and (b), by using the JKDM Form 2 as\n\nprescribed under the Customs Regulations 1977\n\n[P.U. (A) 51/2015].\".\n\nAmendment of Fourth Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 6,
    "text": {
     "en": "6. The Fourth Schedule to the principal Regulations is amended in relation to\n\nTeluk Intan, in column Districts Served by inserting before the words \"Batang Padang\"\n\nthe words \"Bagan Datuk\".\n\nAmendment of Fifth Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 6"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 7,
    "text": {
     "en": "7. The Fifth Schedule to the principal Regulations is amended in relation to\n\nForm GST-03, by substituting for item 15 the following item:\n\n \"Total Value of Other Supplies\".\n\nMade 26 December 2017\n\n[SULIT. KE. HD(122)009/01 Klt. 4(30); Perb. R0.3865/365/1; PN(PU2)721/XI]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\n\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 7"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
