 "MY-H6024": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6024",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pesticides (Exemption) (No. 2) Order 2023.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 1 March 2023.\n\nExemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Subject to paragraph 3, the Minister exempts Behn Meyer Agricare (M) Sdn. Bhd.\n\n(Company Registration Number : 3636-V) in relation to the active ingredient calcium\n\ncyanamide from—\n\n(a) the requirement to register the pesticide under the section 7 of the Act;\n\n(b) the requirement to obtain a licence to manufacture the pesticide under\n\nsection 15 of the Act;\n\n(c) the requirement to obtain a licence to sell or store for sale the pesticide\n\nunder section 17 of the Act; and\n\n(d) the prohibition under subparagraph 53A(1)(a) of the Act for the purposes\n\nof possession or use of the pesticide.\n\nCondition of exemption"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the following conditions:\n\n(a) the company shall apply to registering Perlka as a pesticide; and\n\n(b) the company shall not use the trade name Perlka for fertilizer until\n\n the registration under subsubparagraph (a) is completed.\n\n(2) The Minister may revoke the exemption under paragraph 2 if any condition\n\nunder subparagraph (1) is not complied with.\n\nMade 30 December 2022\n\n[KP/LA/8/11; PN(PU2)275/XXIII]\n\nDATUK SERI HAJI MOHAMAD BIN SABU\n\nMinister of Agriculture and Food Security"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
