 "MY-H6027": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6027",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Excise (Payment of Excise Duties\nfor Motor Vehicles) Order 2026.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 February 2026.\n\nRate of excise duties"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Subject to subparagraph (2), the rate of e xcise dut ies specified\nin column (5) of the Schedule to the Excise Duties Order 2025 [P.U. (A) 389/2025 ]\nshall be levied and paid by the licensed manufacturer.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Order, the goods described in column (3)\nof the Schedule to the Excise Duties Order 2025 in relation to the subheadings\nspecified in the Schedule shall be referred to as \"motor vehicles\"  manufactured\nin Malaysia.\n\nMethod of payment"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) A licensed manufacturer shall pay the excise duties for the removal\nof the motor vehicles from the place of manufacture for the purpose of registration of\nthe motor vehicles under any written law relating to road transport.\n\n(2) The Director General may  allow a security to be given by\nthe licensed manufacturer or agent authorized by the  licensed manufacturer\nfor the payment of excise duties referred to in subparagraph (1).\n\n(3) The licensed manufactur er who is allowed by the Director General\nto give a security under subparagraph (2) shall pay the excise dut ies\nunder subparagraph (1) if—\n\n(a) the Director General has reason to believe that the motor vehicles\nwill not be registered under any written law relating to\nroad transport; or\n\n(b) the motor vehicles are not registered under any written law\nrelating to road transport within the period of four years from\nthe date o f removal of such motor vehicles from the place of\nmanufacture.\n\n(4) In this paragraph, \"place of manufacture\" means the place of manufacture\nof motor vehicles as specified in the licence issued to the licensed manufacturer.\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. The Excise Duties (Motor Vehicles) (Payment) Order 2022 [ P.U. (A)  173/2022]\nis revoked."
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
