 "MY-H6088": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6088",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Poisons (Amendment of Poisons List) Order 2025.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Poisons Act 1952 is amended in the First Schedule —\n\n(a) in the Poisons List—\n\n(i) by inserting after item \"Atracurium; it salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Avalglucosidase alfa - All preparations\";\n\n(ii) by inserting after item \"Axitinib\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Azacitidine - All preparations\";\n\n(iii) by inserting after item \"Bortezomib\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Bosutinib - All preparations\";\n\n(iv) by inserting after item \"Cladribine\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Clascoterone - All preparations\";\n\n(v) by inserting after item \"Chlormethiazole; its salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and\n\nparticulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Chlormethine - All preparations\";\n\n(vi) by inserting after item \"Dehydroemetine; its salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and\n\nparticulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Delamanid - All preparations\";\n\n(vii) by inserting after item \"Escitalopram\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Eslicarbazepine\n\nacetate\n\n- All preparations\";\n\n(viii) by inserting after item \"Finasteride\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Finerenone - All preparations\";\n\n(ix) by inserting after item \"Losartan; its salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Lotilaner - All preparations\";\n\n(x) by inserting after item \"Miconazole; its salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Midodrine\n\nhydrochloride\n\n- All preparations\";\n\n(xi) by inserting after item \"Miglitol\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Milbemycin oxime - All preparations\";\n\n(xii) in the list of \"Monoclonal antibody; includes the following:\" —\n\n(A) by inserting after item \"Emicizumab\" item \"Enfortumab\"; and\n\n(B) by inserting after item \"Mepolizumab\" item \"Mosunetuzumab\";\n\n(xiii) by inserting after item \"Olaquindox\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Olipudase alfa - All preparations\";\n\n(xiv) by inserting after item \"Omidenepag\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Onasemnogene\n\nabeparvovec\n\n- All preparations\";\n\n(xv) by inserting after item \"Sodium cromoglycate\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and\n\nparticulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Sodium hyaluronate - - All preparations\n\nfor parenteral\n\nadministration\";\n\n- - All preparations\n\nunless in Group C\";\n\n(xvi) by inserting after item \"Tegaserod\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Tegoprazan - All preparations\"; and\n\n(xvii) by inserting after item \"Tirofiban\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and particulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Tirzepatide - All preparations\"; and\n\n(b) in the Appendix to the Poisons List—\n\n(i) in the list of \"Anthelmintics:\", by inserting after item \"Melarsomine\" item \"Milbemycin oxime\";\n\n(ii) in the list of \"Anticonvulsants:\", by inserting after item \"Carbamazepine\" item \"Eslicarbazepine acetate\";\n\n(iii) in the list of \"Antidiabetics:\", by inserting after item \"Sitagliptin\" item \"Tirzepatide\";\n\n(iv) in the list of \"Antineoplastic agents and Immunosuppressants:\"—\n\n(A) by inserting after item \"Axitinib\" item \"Azacitidine\";\n\n(B) by inserting after item \"Bortezomib\" item \"Bosutinib\";\n\n(C) by inserting after item \"Chlorambucil; its salts\" item \"Chlormethine\";\n\n(D) by inserting after item \"Durvalumab\" item \"Enfortumab\"; and\n\n(E) by inserting after item \"Mitoxantrone; its salts\" item \"Mosunetuzumab\";\n\n(v) in the list of \"Antitubercular agents:\", by inserting after item \"Bedaquiline\" item \"Delamanid\";\n\n(vi) in the list of \"Anti-ulcer agents:\", by inserting after item \"Roxatidine\" item \"Tegoprazan\";\n\n(vii) in the list of \"Diuretics:\", by inserting after item \"Ethacrynic acid; its salts\" item \"Finerenone\";\n\n(viii) in the list of \"Sympathomimetic amines:\", by inserting after item \"Indanazoline; its salts\" item \"Midodrine\n\nhydrochloride\"; and\n\n(ix) in the list of \"Miscellaneous:\" —\n\n(A) by inserting after item \"Atosiban\" item \"Avalglucosidase alfa\";\n\n(B) by inserting after item \"Citicoline\" item \"Clascoterone\";\n\n(C) by inserting after item \"Lonoctocog alfa\" item \"Lotilaner\";\n\n(D) by inserting after item \"Olaquindox\" item \"Olipudase alfa\";\n\n(E) by inserting after item \"Omidenepag\" item \"Onasemnogene abeparvovec\"; and\n\n(F) by inserting after item \"Sodium cromoglycate\" item \"Sodium hyaluronate\".\n\nMade 21 November 2025\n\n[KKM.600-18/2/95; PN(PU2)172/JLD.21]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. HAJI DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMinister of Health"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
