     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Income Tax (Deduction for Expenses   in\nrelation to Secretarial Fee and Tax Filing Fee) (Amendment) Rules 2021.\n\n (2) These Rules have effect from the year of assessment 2022.\n\nAmendment of rule 2"
