     "en": "1. (1)  This order may be cited as the Sales Tax (Imposition of Sales Tax\nin respect of Designated Areas) (Amendment) Order 2025.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 1 January 2026.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2"
