  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Dental (Amendment of Second Schedule)\n\nOrder 2014.\n\nAmendment of the Second Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Second Schedule to the Act is amended in relation to the country of \"India\"—\n\n (a) by inserting after the item \"A.B. Shetty Memorial Institute of Dental\n\nScience, Mangalore\" and the particulars appearing against it, the following\n\nitem and particulars:\n\nInstitution granting\n\nqualification\n\nDescription of\n\nqualification\n\n\"A.B. Shetty Memorial Institute of\n\nDental Sciences, Mangalore, Nitte\n\nUniversity\n\n(formerly known as A.B. Shetty\n\nMemorial Institute of Dental Science,\n\nMangalore)\n\nBachelor of Dental\n\nSurgery (B.D.S.)\n\n(Recognized on\n\n4 June 2008)\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting after the item \"Meenakshi Ammal Dental College, Dr. M.G.R.\n\nTamil Nadu University\" and the particulars appearing against it, the\n\nfollowing item and particulars:\n\nInstitution granting\n\nqualification\n\nDescription of\n\nqualification\n\n\"Meenakshi Ammal Dental College\n\n& Hospital, Meenakshi Academy of\n\nHigher Education & Research\n\n(formerly known as Meenakshi Ammal\n\nDental College, Dr. M.G.R Tamil Nadu\n\nUniversity)\n\nBachelor of Dental\n\nSurgery (B.D.S.)\n\n(Recognized on\n\n31 March 2004)\".\n\nMade 6 January 2014\n\n[KKM-60(20/2)/1/7; PN(PU2)93/V]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\nMinister of Health"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
