 "MY-H6242": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6242",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Anti-Money Laundering , Anti -Terrorism\nFinancing and Proceeds of Unlawful Activities Act  (Invocation of Part IV)  (No. 2)\n(Amendment) Order 2021.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Anti -Money Laundering (Invocation of Part IV) (No. 2)  Order 2004\n[P.U. (A) 340/2004] is amended by substituting for paragraph 2 the following paragraph:\n\n\"Invocation of paragraph 14(1)(b), and sections 20 and 24\n2.  (1) Paragraph 14 (1)(b), and sections 20 and 24 of the Act shall be\ninvoked on any reporting institution carrying out any activity specified in\nparagraphs 9, 10, 11 and 12 of the First Schedule to the Act when the reporting\ninstitution prepares or carries out the following activities\nfor its clients:\n\n(a) buying and selling of immovable property;\n\n(b) managing client's money, securities or other property;\n\n(c) managing of accounts including savings and securities\naccounts;\n\n(d) organizing of contributions for the creation, operation or\nmanagement of companies; or\n\n(e) creating, operatin g or managing of legal entities or\narrangements, and buying and selling of business entities.\n\n(2) Paragraph 14(1) (b), and sections 20 and  24 of the Act shall be\ninvoked on any reporting institution carrying out any activity specified in\nparagraph 13 of the First Schedule to  the Act when the reporting institution\nprepares or carries out the following activities for its clients:\n\n(a) acting as a formation agent of legal entities;\n\n(b) acting as (or arranging for another person to act as)\na director or secretary of a company, a partner of\na partnership, or a similar position in relation to other\nlegal entities;\n\n(c) providing a registered office, busine ss address or\naccommodation, correspondence or administrative address\nfor a company, a partnership or any other legal entities or\narrangement;\n\n(d) acting as (or arranging for another person to act as)\na trustee of an expressed trust; or\n\n(e) acting as (or arrang ing for another person to act as)\na nominee shareholder for another person.\".\n\nMade 24 December 2021\n[BNM.JUN 1125/36/03; PN(PU2)622/JLD.42]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMinister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
