     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Land Public Transpor t\n(Compounding of Offences) (Amendment) Regulations 2013.\n\n (2) These Regulations come into operation on  the date the Regulations are\npublished in the Gazette.\n\nAmendment of regulation 2"
