    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Ministers of the Federal Government\n\n(Amendment) Order 2020.\n\n(2) Subparagraph 2(a) is deemed to have come into operation on 3 January 2020.\n\n(3) Subparagraphs 2(b) and 2(c) are deemed to have come into operation\n\non 21 May 2018.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    },
