 "MY-H6330": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6330",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Federal Roads (Private Management)\n\n(Collection of Tolls) (Johor Causeway-Johor Bahru-Tampoi Highway)\n\n(Amendment) Order 2026.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 6 February 2026.\n\nSubstitution of paragraph 3"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Federal Roads (Private Management) (Collection of Tolls) (Johor Causeway\u0002Johor Bahru-Tampoi Highway) Order 1989 [P.U. (A) 14/1989] is amended by substituting\n\nfor paragraph 3 the following paragraph:\n\n\"Payment of toll 3. (1) A driver of a vehicle who uses—\n\n(a) a valid debit card, credit card or prepaid card;\n\n(b) an electronic device with a valid prepaid card;\n\n(c) a valid electronic sticker which has been\n\ninstalled on the windscreen, headlamp of\n\nthe vehicle or on any other parts of the vehicle\n\nwhich has been determined for its installation;\n\nor\n\n(d) an application for Automatic Number Plate\n\nRecognition System,\n\nshall pay the amount of toll payable under\n\nsubparagraph 2(1) when passing through a dedicated\n\ntoll lane at the toll plaza as shown on the map in\n\nthe Second Schedule.\n\n(2) For the purpose of payment of toll under\n\nsubparagraph (1), a driver of a vehicle shall—\n\n(a) touch the valid debit card, credit card or\n\nprepaid card on the electronic machine\n\nreader;\n\n(b) display the electronic device with a valid\n\nprepaid card;\n\n(c) display a valid electronic sticker which has\n\nbeen installed on the windscreen,\n\nheadlamp of the vehicle or on any other\n\nparts of the vehicle which has been\n\ndetermined for its installation; or\n\n(d) display a valid vehicle registration\n\nnumber plate in accordance with\n\nthe applicable laws and ensure the vehicle\n\nregistration number is registered with\n\na valid open payment application with\n\na valid and active mode of payment.\n\n(3) A driver of a vehicle who uses a debit card,\n\na credit card, a prepaid card, an electronic device with\n\nprepaid card, an electronic sticker or an application for\n\nAutomatic Number Plate Recognition System shall ensure\n\nmoney in the debit card, credit card, prepaid card,\n\nelectronic device with prepaid card, electronic sticker or\n\napplication for Automatic Number Plate Recognition\n\nSystem is sufficient for the purpose of payment of toll.\n\n(4) The electronic sticker which has been installed\n\nfor the purpose of subparagraph (1) shall not be\n\ntransferred or moved to another vehicle in any manner\n\nwhatsoever.\n\n(5) A driver of a vehicle who has installed a valid\n\nelectronic sticker shall not do or cause to be done any\n\nmodification to the electronic sticker or any act which may\n\ninterfere with the function of the electronic sticker.\n\n(6) \"Prepaid card\", \"electronic device with prepaid\n\ncard\" or \"electronic sticker\" referred to in this paragraph\n\nmeans a prepaid card, an electronic device with prepaid\n\ncard or an electronic sticker as approved by the Minister\n\nand issued for the purpose of payment of toll.\".\n\nMade 29 January 2026\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/43; PN(PU2)426/JLD.74]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMinister of Works"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H6332": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6332",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Trade Descriptions (Certification and\nMarking of Halal) (Amendment) Order 2012.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 1 March 2012.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Trade Descriptions (Certification and  Marking of Halal) Order 2011\n[P.U. (A) 431/2011 ], which is referred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is\namended in paragraph 2 by substituting the for word \"manner\" the word \"expression\".\n\nAmendment of paragraph 4"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Paragraph 4 of the principal Order is amended—\n\n(a) in subparagraph (1), by substituting for the word \"manner\" the\nword \"expression\";\n\n(b) by substituting for subparagraph (2) the following subparagraph:\n\n \"(2) The services in relation to the food or goods shall not\nbe described as halal or be described in other expression to\nindicate that the services can be used by a Muslim unless it is—\n\n (a) certified as halal by the competent authority;\n and\n\n (b) marked with the logo as specified in the\n First Schedule .\"; and\n\n (c) by inserting after subparagraph (2) the following subparagraph:\n\n\"(3) Notwithstanding subparagraph (1), all food supplied\nby a non -Muslim which is intended to be described in other\nexpression to indicate that the food, goods and services in\nrelation to th e food or goods can be consumed or used by a\nMuslim shall—\n\n    (a) be certified as halal by the competent\n   authority; and\n\n(b) be marked with a logo as specified in the\n First Schedule.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 6"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Paragraph 6 of the principal Order is amended—\n\n(a) by substituting for the shoulder note the following shoulder note:\n\"Marking of food, goods and services\";\n\n(b) by renumbering the existing paragraph as subparagraph (1);\n\n(c) in subparagraph (1) by substituting for the word \"manner\" the\nword \"expression\"; and\n\n(d) by inserting after subparagraph (1) the following subparagraph:\n\n\"(2) All services in relation to the food or goods which\nare intended to be marked in accordance with paragraphs 4 and\n5 shall be marked with any expression which may be considered\n\nas referring to the said services including the premise where the\nservice is provided.\".\n\nAmendment of paragraph 9"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. Paragraph 9 of the principal Order is amended—\n\n(a) by renumbering the existing paragraph as subparagraph (1); and\n\n(b) by inserting after subparagraph (1) the following subparagraph:\n\n               \"(2) All imported food or goods which are intended to be\ndescribed as halal shall comply with the requirement in\nparagraph 5 within one year from the commencement of this\nOrder.\".\n\nAmendment of Schedules"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 6,
    "text": {
     "en": "6. The Schedules to the principal Order is amended in the English text—\n\n(a)   by substituting for the word s \"Schedule 1\" the word s \"First\nSchedule\"; and\n\n                        (b)   by substituting for the word s \"Schedule 2\" the word s \"Second\nSchedule\".\n\nMade 29 February 2012\n[KPDN(PUU)(PU2)26/5/5; PN(PU2)120/VI]\n\n      DATO' SRI ISMAIL SABRI BIN YAAKOB\n                Minister of Domestic Trade,\n             Co-operatives and Consumerism"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 6"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
