    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Tabung Haji (Disciplinary\n\nCommittees and Disciplinary Appeal Committees) (Amendment) Regulations\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 7 March 2014.\n\nAmendment of Schedule"
    },
