     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Fees (Employment Pass,\n\nVisit Pass (Temporary Employment) and Work Pass) (Amendment) Order 2016.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 18 March 2016.\n\nAmendment of Schedule I"
