    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Fees (Employment Pass, Visit Pass (Temporary Employment) and Work\n\nPass) Order 1998 [P.U. (A) 479/1998] is amended by substituting for Schedule I\n\nthe following Schedule:\n\n\"SCHEDULE I\n\n [Paragraph 3]\n\nPass Holder Fee per month Processing\n\nfee for each\n\napplication\n\nPeninsular\n\nMalaysia\n\nSabah/\n\nSarawak/\n\nLabuan\n\nRM RM RM\n\n(a) Employment Pass/\n\nWork Pass\n\n- - 125.00\n\n(b) Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary Employment)\n\nholder working in\n\nmanufacturing sector\n\n154.16 84.16 125.00\n\nPass Holder Fee per month Processing\n\nfee for each\n\napplication\n\nPeninsular\n\nMalaysia\n\nSabah/\n\nSarawak/\n\nLabuan\n\nRM RM RM\n\n(c) Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary\n\nEmployment)\n\nholder working\n\nin construction sector\n\n154.16 84.16 125.00\n\n(d) Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary\n\nEmployment)\n\nholder working in\n\nplantation sector\n\n53.33 49.16 125.00\n\n(e) Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary\n\nEmployment)\n\nholder working in\n\nagriculture sector\n\n53.33 34.16 125.00\n\n(f) Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary\n\nEmployment)\n\nholder working in\n\nservices sector for\n\nthe following activities:\n\n(i) restaurant\n\n(ii) washing and cleaning\n\n(iii) cargo handling\n\n(iv) launderettes\n\n(v) caddy\n\n(vi) hair dresser\n\n(vii) wholesale and retail\n\nbusiness\n\n(viii) textile business\n\n(ix) scrap and used metal\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n124.16\n\n124.16\n\n124.16\n\n124.16\n\n124.16\n\n124.16\n\n124.16\n\n124.16\n\n124.16\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\nPass Holder Fee per month Processing\n\nfee for each\n\napplication\n\nPeninsular\n\nMalaysia\n\nSabah/\n\nSarawak/\n\nLabuan\n\nRM RM RM\n\n(x) welfare home\n\n(xi) resort island\n\n154.16\n\n154.16\n\n54.16\n\n84.16\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n(g) Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary\n\nEmployment) holder\n\nworking as domestic\n\nmaid for\n\n(i) first maid\n\n(ii) second and subsequent\n\nmaid\n\n34.16\n\n49.16\n\n34.16\n\n49.16\n\n125.00\n\n125.00\n\n(h) Visit Pass\n\n(Temporary\n\nEmployment)\n\nholder working in\n\nall types of work other\n\nthan those referred to in\n\nparagraphs (b)-(g)\n\n154.16 124.16 125.00\n\nMade 18 March 2016\n\n[KDN (S): 100/508/3 Jld. (4); PN(PU2)86/XVII]\n\nBy Command,\n\n TAN SRI DR. ALI BIN HAMSA\n\n Secretary to the Cabinet\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Fees Act 1951]\n\n\"."
    },
