 "MY-H6557": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6557",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Service Tax (Rate of Digital Services Tax)\n(Amendment) Order 2024.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 1 March 2024.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Service Tax (Rate of  Digital Services Tax) Order 2019 [P.U. (A) 271/2019]\nis amended in paragraph 2 by substituting for the words \"six percent\"  the words\n\"eight per cent\".\n\nSaving"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) Any digital service provided before the date of coming into operation  of\nthis Order and the provision of the digital service spanning after the date of coming into\noperation of this Order, the service tax shall be charged at the rate of eight per cent  of\nthe value of the digital service charged by a foreign registered person on the proportion\nof the digital service which is attributed to the part of the period after the date of coming\ninto operation of this Order.\n\n(2)  Any digital service provided on or after the date of coming into operation\nof this Order, any payment received before the date of coming into operation  of this\nOrder in relation to the digital service, the service tax on the payment received shall be\ncharged at the rate of six per cent of the value of the digital service charged by a foreign\nregistered person.\n\nMade 22 February 2024\n[KE.HF (152) 899/03 JLD 2 (7); MOF.TAX(S)700-1/2/27 Jld.4; PN(PU2)752/JLD.5]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n                                                               Second Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 10(3) of\nthe Service Tax Act 2018]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
