     "en": "2. The Customs (Prohibition of Exports) Order 2017 [P.U. (A) 102/2017] is amended\nin the Second Schedule, in relation to item 6—\n\n(a) in column (2), by deleting subitems (24) and (25) and the particulars\nrelating to them in column (3); and\n\n(b) in column (5) , in  paragraph (iii), by substituting for the words\n\"Forest Department Sarawak\"  the words  \"Sarawak Timber Industry\nDevelopment Corporation (STIDC)\".\n\nMade 11 March 2019\n[SULIT KE.HT (96)669/15 -36/Klt.18/S.k.54/(5); Perb. 0.9060/18 JLD.35(SK.2)(8) &\nJLD.35(28); PN(PU2)80/XCII]\n\n                LIM GUAN ENG\n               Minister of Finance"
