 "MY-H6687": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6687",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These by-laws may be cited as the Prohibition Against Spitting\n\n(Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur) By-Laws 2017.\n\n(2) These By-laws shall come into operation on 15 March 2017.\n\nInterpretation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In these By-laws, unless the context otherwise requires—\n\n\"spitting\" means an act of discharging any liquid from the mouth and includes\n\ndischarging any liquid from the nose;\n\n\"public place\" shall have the same meaning assigned to it under section 2 of the\n\nLocal Government Act 1976 [Act 171].\n\nProhibition against spitting"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. No person shall spit in any public place except in a place designated for cleansing\n\nor into any apparatus provided for spitting.\n\nPenalty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any person who contravenes the provisions of these By-laws commits an offence\n\nand shall, upon conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding two thousand ringgit or\n\nto imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both.\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. The Prohibition Against Spitting (Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur) By-Laws\n\n1991 [P.U. (A) 155/1991] is revoked.\n\nMade 23 February 2017\n\n[DBKL/JUP/BPPP/11/2009; PN(PU2)328A/XXX]\n\nDATUK SERI HJ. MHD AMIN NORDIN BIN ABD. AZIZ\n\nCommissioner of the City of Kuala Lumpur\n\nConfirmed 10 March 2017\n\n[KWP(S) 24/907/80/1/4; PN(PU2)328A/XXX]\n\nDATUK SERI TENGKU ADNAN BIN TENGKU MANSOR\n\nMinister of Federal Territories"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
