 "MY-H6774": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6774",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 2) Order 2013.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 4 March 2013.\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2.   Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53] shall be remitted in full\nin respect of any money payable under any agreement, note, instrument or document in\nrelation to any of the Isl amic Medium Term Notes issued pursuant to the Islamic\nMedium Term Notes Programme in nominal value of one billion ringgit\n(RM1,000,000,000.00) ( the \"IMTN Programme\") by Sarawak Hidro Sdn. Bhd.\n(the \"Issuer\") including , but not limited  to any agreement, note, instrument and\ndocument in relation to the guarantee ( the \"Guarantee\") provided or to be provided by\nthe Government of Malaysia, which is payable by—\n\n(a) the Issuer, to which this Act applies by virtue of t he Loans Guarantee\n(Declaration of Bodies Corporate) (Sarawak Hidro Sdn. Bhd. ) Order 2012\n[P.U. (A) 276/2012];\n\n(b) any holder of the Islamic Medium Term Notes; or\n\n(c) any other party to any agreement, note , instrument  and document in\nrelation to the Islamic Medium Term Notes, the IMTN Programme or the\nGuarantee, including any  party to whom such agreement, note, instrument\nand document is transferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any stamp duty payable under t he Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instrument and document  in relation to the Islamic Medium Term\nNotes, the IMTN Programme or the Guarantee shall be remitted in full.\n\nMade 25 February 2013\n[KK/BPKA/M(S)/702/1/1JLD.3(12); PN(PU2)232/VIII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
