 "MY-H6850": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6850",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1.  (1)   This order may be cited as the  Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate)\n(Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 2) Order 2015.\n\n(2)  This Order comes into operation on 15 May 2015.\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53] by any of the following\nindividual or entity in respect of any money payable under any agreement, note,\ninstrument and document in relation to the product, facility, programme and guarantee\nreferred to in paragraph 4 shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) Jambatan Kedua Sdn. Bhd. to which the Act applies by virtue of the Loans\nGuarantee (Declaration of Bodies Corporate) (Jambatan Kedua Sdn . Bhd.)\nOrder 2009 [P.U. (A) 29/2009];\n\n(b) any holder of the Sukuk Murabahah; or\n\n(c) any other party to any agreement, note, instrument and document in\nrelation to the Sukuk Murabahah Programme or the guarantee provided\nor to be provided by the Government of Malaysia, including any party to\nwhom such agreement, note, instrument and document is transferred or\nassigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instrument and document in relation to the product, facility,\nprogramme and guarantee referred to in paragraph 4 shall be remitted in full.\n\nApplication"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. This Order shall apply to:\n\n(a) Sukuk Murabahah issued or to be issued by Jambatan Kedua Sdn . Bhd.\npursuant to the Sukuk Murabahah Programme in nominal value of up to\nfour billion six hundred million ringgit (RM4,600,000,000.00):\n\nProvided that, the combined aggregate of the outstanding nominal\nvalue of the Sukuk Murabahah and the outstanding principal amount\nunder the Syndicated Murabahah Tawarruq Short Term Revolving Credit\nFacility, which in this Order is referred to as the \" Syndicated RC-i Facility\",\nshall not exceed four billion six hundred m illion ringgit\n(RM4,600,000,000.00);\n\n(b) the Syndicated RC-i Facility in the aggregate outstanding principal amount\nnot exceeding one billion five hundred m illion ringgit\n(RM1,500,000,000.00) subject to the combined aggregate mentioned\nin subparagraph (a);\n\n(c) the Sukuk Murabahah Programme in nominal value of up to four billion\nsix hundred million ringgit (RM4,600,000,000.00); and\n\n(d) the guarantee provided or to be provided by the Government of Malaysia\nrelating to the Sukuk Murabahah, the Sukuk Murabahah Programme and\nthe Syndicated RC-i Facility.\n\nMade 14 May 2015\n[KK/SID/(S)393/6/1(15); PN(PU2)232/X]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
