 "MY-H6877": {
  "lawId": "MY-H6877",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order  may be cited as the Capital Markets and Services\n(Prescription For Excluded Offers And Invitations And Excluded Issues For\nSeasoned Bonds) Order 2018.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 5 April 2018.\n\nInterpretation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. In this Order, \"seasoned bonds\" means any debenture or sukuk  that complies with\nthe Seasoned Bonds Framework as may be specified by the Commission.\n\nOffers and invitations for seasoned b onds prescribed to be e xcluded offers and\ninvitations"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. An offer for subscription or purchase of, or an invitati on to subscribe for  or\npurchase of, seasoned bonds is prescribed as an excluded offer or an excluded invitation.\n\nIssue of seasoned bonds prescribed to be excluded issues"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. An issue of seasoned bonds is prescribed as an excluded issue.\n\nNon-application of sections 232, 233, 234, 235, 236, 237, 238, 239, 240, 241\nand 244"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. Sections 232, 233, 234, 235, 236, 237, 238, 239, 240, 241 and 244 shall not apply\nto any excluded offer, excluded invitation or excluded issue of seasoned bonds.\n\nNon-application of sections 263, 266, 268, 269, 271, 272, 275,  278,\nsubsections 280(4) and (5)"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 6,
    "text": {
     "en": "6. Sections 263, 266, 268, 269, 271, 272, 275,  278, subsections 280(4) and (5) of the\nAct shall not apply to seasoned bonds.\n\nMade 26 March 2018\n[KK/SID/(S)/483/669/4JLD.2(SK.11); GC(LR)RETAIL BONDS DISCLOSURE FWORK\n1/2017(243)-1/; PN(PU2)662/XIII]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 6"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
