     "en": "1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Food (Amendment)\n\nRegulations 2017.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 15 April 2017 except\n\nparagraphs 2(b) and 2(c).\n\n(3) Paragraphs 2(b) and 2(c) come into operation on 15 April 2018.\n\nAmendment of regulation 26"
