    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Price Control and Ant i-Profiteering\n(Determination of Maximum Price) (No. 3) Order 2015.\n\n (2) This Order has effect for the period from 24 May 2015 to 2 June 2015.\n\nMaximum producer price"
    },
