     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Local Speed Limit (Federal Roads)\n\n(West Malaysia) (Amendment) (No. 2) Order 2013.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 22 March 2013.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
