 "MY-H710": {
  "lawId": "MY-H710",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Sales Tax ( Rate of Tax ) (Amendment)\nOrder 2023.\n\n (2) This Order comes into operation on 1 April 2023.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Sales Tax ( Rate of Tax ) Order 2022 [ P.U. (A) 176/2022 ] is amended\nin subparagraph 2(1) by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph:\n\n\"(b) goods imported on or with any person entering Malaysia or in the\nbaggage of such person and the goods are not for commercial use,\nexcluding—\n(i) motor vehicles;\n\n(ii) alcoholic beverages;\n\n(iii) spirits;\n\n(iv) cigarettes;\n\n(v) tobacco products;\n\n(vi) smoking pipes (including pipe bowls);\n\n(vii) electronic cigarettes and similar personal electric vaporizing\ndevices;\n\n(viii) preparation of a kind used for smoking through electronic\ncigarettes and electric vaporizing device, in form of liquid\nor gel, whether or not containing nicotine;\n\n(ix) tyres; and\n\n(x) tube.\".\n\nMade 29 March 2023\n[SULITKE.HT(152)899/04; KE.HF(152)899/04 JLD.2(20); PN(PU2)751/VI]\n\n                                                                              ANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\n                                                                             Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 10(3) of the Sales Tax Act 2018]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
