 "MY-H749": {
  "lawId": "MY-H749",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee\n(Bodies Corporate) (Remission of Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 3) Order 2022.\n\nApplication"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. This Order shall apply to—\n\n(a) the Term Financing -i Facility obtained by the\nPublic Sector Home Financing Board from CIMB Islamic Bank Berhad with\nthe aggregate principal amount not exceeding one billion ringgit\n(RM1,000,000,000.00) which is referred to as the \"TF -i Facility\" in this\nOrder; and\n\n(b) the guarantee given or to be given by the Government of Malaysia\nin relation to the TF-i Facility.\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53] by any of the following\nindividual or entity in respect of any mon ey payable under any agreement, instrument\nand document in relation to the TF -i Facility an d the guarantee referred to in\nparagraph 2 shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) the Public Sector Home Financing Board to which the\nLoans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate) Act  1965 applies by virtue of the\nLoans Guarantee (Declaration of Bodies Corporate)\n(Public Sector Home Financing Board) Order 2016 [P.U. (A) 198/2016];\n\n(b) CIMB Islamic Bank Berhad; or\n\n(c) any other party to any agreement, instrument and document in relation\nto the TF-i Facility and the guarantee referred to in paragraph 2, including\nany party to whom any such agreement, instrument and document is\ntransferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ]\nin respect of any agreement, instrument and document in relation to\nthe TF-i Facility and the guarantee referred to in paragraph 2 shall be remitted in full.\n\nMade 8 April 2022\n[MOF. SID(S) 700-14/2/11 JD.5; PN(PU2)232/XVI]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n                                         Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
