 "MY-H779": {
  "lawId": "MY-H779",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Co-operative Societies (Assumption of Control of\nKoperasi Serbausaha Makmur Berhad) (Appointment) Order 2023.\n\nAssumption of control"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Commission appoints Dato' Haji Zazali bin Haron to assume control of\nthe whole of the property, business, activities and affairs of the Koperasi Serbausaha\nMakmur Berhad, and carry on the whole of its business, activities and affairs for\nthe period from 26 March 2023 to 25 March 2024 or until a new Board is elected\nunder the by-laws of the Koperasi, whichever is earlier.\n\nCosts, expenses and remuneration"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. Any costs and expenses incurred by the Commission, and the remuneration\nof the person appointed under paragraph 2, in relation to the assumption\nof control under paragraph 2 shall be payable out of the funds and properties\nof the Koperasi Serbausaha Makmur Berhad as a first charge.\n\nMade 31 March 2023\n[SKM.IP(SULIT)KP:3437B/1/3; PN(PU2)527/Jld. 21]\n\nDATUK UMAR SARIM BIN SAIDIN\nDeputy Executive Chairman\nMalaysia Co-operative Societies Commission"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
