 "MY-H807": {
  "lawId": "MY-H807",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Employees Provident Fund\n\n(Amendment) Rules 2022.\n\n (2) These Rules have effect for the period from 15 April 2022 to 30 June 2022.\n\nAmendment of rule 41"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Employees Provident Fund Rules 1991 [P.U. (A) 493/1991] are amended\n\nin rule 41 by inserting after subrule (10ZH) the following subrules:\n\n\"Member of Fund\n\nrequires financing for\n\npurpose of assisting him\n\nin covering his financial\n\ncommitment which is\n\naffected due to\n\nCoronavirus Disease\n\n2019 (COVID-19)\n\npandemic for notice of\n\nwithdrawal given to\n\nBoard until 30 April 2022.\n\n(10ZI) Where a notice of withdrawal is\n\nmade under paragraph 54(6)(n) of the Act on the\n\nground that a member of the Fund requires\n\nfinancing for the purpose of assisting him in\n\ncovering his financial commitment which is affected\n\ndue to the Coronavirus Disease 2019 (COVID-19)\n\npandemic for the notice of withdrawal given to\n\nthe Board until 30 April 2022, the member of the\n\nFund shall give a notice of withdrawal to the Board\n\nin accordance with any manner as determined by\n\nthe Board.\n\n(10ZJ) The notice of withdrawal referred\n\nto in subrule (10ZI) shall be submitted by the\n\nmember of the Fund to the Board at any time\n\nuntil 30 April 2022.\n\n(10ZK) Where the Board is satisfied with the\n\nnotice of withdrawal submitted by the member of\n\nthe Fund, the Board may authorize the member of\n\nthe Fund to withdraw an amount not less than\n\nfifty ringgit and not exceeding ten thousand ringgit\n\non the date of the notice of withdrawal is authorized\n\nsubject to—\n\n(a) the amount standing to the\n\ncredit in Account II of the\n\nmember of the Fund is fully\n\nutilized; and\n\n(b) the amount standing to the\n\ncredit in Account I of the\n\nmember of the Fund is\n\nutilized if there is any\n\ndeficiency in the amount\n\nstanding to the credit\n\nreferred to in paragraph (a)\n\nfor the purposes of the\n\nwithdrawal.\n\n(10ZL) For the purposes of subrule (10ZK),\n\nthe amount of withdrawal shall be paid to the\n\nmember of the Fund in lump sum.\n\n(10ZM) The member of the Fund shall,\n\non the date of the withdrawal, have an amount\n\nstanding to his credit in Account I at least\n\none hundred ringgit.\n\n(10ZN) Where the member of the Fund has\n\nsubmitted the notice of withdrawal under\n\nsubrule (10ZI) to the Board, such notice of\n\nwithdrawal shall not be revoked.\".\n\nMade 13 April 2022\n\n[MOF.SBM(R) 600-41/39/91; PN(PU2)498/JLD. 19]\n\n TAN SRI AHMAD BADRI BIN MOHD ZAHIR\n\n Chairman\n\n Employees Provident Fund Board"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
